2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Link''':https://books.google.com/books?id=pmMI8LrxfvMC&pg=PA534&lpg=PA534&dq=william+lupton+and+hopewell+meeting&source=bl&ots=qiDot73s9d&sig=RPJop_kSbd6Fv8LrgUruW-
2 CONT
2 CONT _________________________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT Recorded as written:
2 CONT
2 CONT  Grace Pickering, m. in Virginia, William Lupton and lived in Frederick Co. in 1787, and their son Asa (or Asahel) b. 1757, m. 1787, Hannah Hank, dau. of John, of Rockingham Co., Va., of the same family probably as President Linco
2 CONC ln's mother, and the Hanks mentioned in the Evans Genealogy in this volume.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source''' : Historical Collections Relating to Gwynedd: A Township of Montgomery County ... By Howard Malcolm Jenkin; Pg. 208
2 CONT
