2 CONT D90 WILLIAM H. 4 DENNY (same as above) was 
2 CONT born in Washington Co., Ind., Apr. 8, 1814. He married Mary  Tilford, Mar. 15, 1836. She died in 1863. They moved to Lin¬  coln, Ill., in the 1860’s. His great-granddaughter (No. D807,  this bk.) prizes a walnut table he made of w
2 CONC ood from his father’s  grove. He died June 6, 1895, in Neoga, Ill. 
2 CONT
