2 CONT
2 CONT +162 iv. Thomas Thorne. 
2 CONT
2 CONT +163 v. William Thorne. 
2 CONT
2 CONT +164 vi. James Thorne.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Martha Johanna Bowne was born in Flushing on August 17, 1673. She married Joseph Thorn in 1695.
2 CONT
2 CONT Martha Johanna Bowne and Joseph Thorne were married in Flushing at the home of her sister Hannah Bowne and her husband Benjamin Field. 
