2 CONT Susannah (Booth) Thorne (abt. 1617 - aft. 1676)
2 CONT Born about 1617 [uncertain] in England  [uncertain]
2 CONT Died after 15 Jan 1676 after about age 59 in Flushing, New York 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Family Tree of Susannah (Booth) Thorne
2 CONT
2 CONT SUSANNAH
2 CONT
2 CONT Susannah Thorne formerly Booth aka Hallet
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Nicholas Booth and Elizabeth Booth
2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of Richard Lownsborough and Helen Booth
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of William Thorne Sr. — married about 1630 in England map icon Wife of William Hallett Sr. — married after 1657 [location unknown]
2 CONT
