1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Pickering-223
2 CONT Disputed Parentage and Y-DNA Findings:
2 CONT
2 CONT Many Pickerings, and FindAGrave[1], give the names of Jonathan Pickering and Jane Cromwell of Salem, Massachusetts as the parents of Samuel Pickering who lived in Bucks County, Pennsylvania. They claim that he was born in Salem, M
2 CONC assachusetts and moved to Bucks County, Pennsylvania, although that seems a highly unlikely route of migration in the early 1700s.
2 CONT
2 CONT DNA tests have since proven that there are at least two unrelated lines of Pickerings: that of the Salem, Massachusetts Pickerings and that of the Bucks Co, Pennsylvania Pickerings and the DNA shows they do not match.
2 CONT
2 CONT The FamilyTree Pickering Y-DNA Project establishes that Samuel Pickering does not descend from the Salem, Massachusetts Pickering family. Click on the Y-DNA results tab to see the actual results. https://www.familytreedna.com/publ
2 CONC ic/pickering2?iframe=yresults
2 CONT
2 CONT For the unlinked "parents", see
2 CONT https://www.geni.com/people/Jonathan-Pickering/6000000003076953710?through=6000000000920745835
2 CONT https://www.geni.com/people/Jane-Pickering/6000000003075997071?through=6000000003076953710
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/18951139/samuel-pickering
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source''': A Genealogical and Personal History of Bucks County, Pennsylvania; By William Watts Hart Davis; Genealogical Publishing Co.; Baltimore, Maryland; 1905; P. 699
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Link'': https://books.google.com/books?id=-nEHRwRAwxAC&q=samuel+pickering#v=snippet&q=samuel%20pickering&f=false
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source''': A Genealogical and Personal History of Bucks County, Pennsylvania; By William Watts Hart Davis; Genealogical Publishing Co.; Baltimore, Maryland; 1905; P. 699
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Link'': https://books.google.com/books?id=-nEHRwRAwxAC&q=samuel+pickering#v=snippet&q=samuel%20pickering&f=false
2 CONT --------------------
