2 CONT Son of Jonathan and Jane Cromwell Pickering. Husband of Mary Scarborough. Father of 9 children. Quaker.
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: According to sandy-54@rock.com DNA testing has shown that Samuel Pickering is NOT the son of Jonathon and Jane ( Cromwell ) Pickering.
