1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mary Scarborough Pickering Lupton was born on October 9, 1695. She was the daughter of John Scarborough and Mary Pierson. '''Note: She is a "Pennsylvania Scarborough" and only remotely related, if that, to the Scar
2 CONC burghs of Accomack/Northampton County, VA'''.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Samuel Pickering in 1712. Samuel was baptized on August 3, 1684 in Salem, Essex County Massachusetts.
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel died on August 10, 1727.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Joseph Lupton in 1730. Their children and life together are described in detail in the section on Joseph and Mary Lupton.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary died on May 25, 1760. Frederick County, Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Link:http://www.anamericanfamilyhistory.com/Lupton%20Family/ScarboroughMaryPickeringLupton.html
2 CONT
2 CONT                                            <nowiki>-------------------------------------------------------------------</nowiki>
2 CONT
2 CONT  Mary Scarborough, b. 8/8m/1695 in Middletown; d. 10 January 1787 in Opeckan, Frederick Co., Va.; m(1) 7/9m/1712 Samuel PICKERING; m(2) 1730 Joseph LUPTON Jr.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Link: http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~paxson/scarborough/Scarborough.index.html
