1 NOTE {geni:about_me} William Pickering in Hopewell MM, Frederick County, VA; born 01 Jan 1726/27 in Solebury MM, Bucks County, PA; died 10 Jan 1789 in Frederick County, VA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Sarah Wright, 1749 in Hopewell MM, Frederick County, VA; (born 25 Mar 1727 in Monocacy, Prince George County, MD; died Aft. 1789;)
2 CONT
