2 CONT Joseph Lupton BIRTH	1686 England DEATH	9 Aug 1758 (aged 71–72) Frederick County, Virginia, USA BURIAL	Non-Cemetery Burial, Specifically: The exact location is unknown  MEMORIAL ID	168863644 · View Source
2 CONT
2 CONT MEMORIAL PHOTOS 0 FLOWERS 2 Son of Joseph Lupton 1645 Yorkshire, Eng.--1731 Yorks. Eng. and Ann Hall 1650 Eng.--1737 Yorks., Eng. Married Mercy Twining 8 Sep 1690, Eastham, Barnstable, MA--25 May 1726, Bucks Co, PA. 10th July 1713
2 CONC  Newtown, Bucks Co, PA. Mercy is d/o Stephen Twining 1659 MA--1720 PA and Abigail Young 1660 MA--1715 PA. Children: William Lupton 1714--1783 m/ Grace S Pickering d/o Samuel Pickering 1684 and Mary Scarborough 1694. Sarah Lupton 1
2 CONC 716--1778 Pa Joseph Lupton 1718--1791 Va Elizabeth Lupton 1722--1801 Pa John Lupton 1724--1804 m/ 1)Sarah Frost; 2)Ann Neill.
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel Pickering passed Jan 1727. Mercy Lupton passed May 1726. Joseph Lupton m/ Mary (Scarborough) Pickering July 1730. Their children: Ann 1733--1813 Ohio Mercy 1735--1760 Va Jonathan B. 1739--1819.
2 CONT
2 CONT Family Members Spouse Photo	 Mary Scarborough Pickering Lupton 1694–1786 (m. 1730)
2 CONT
