2 CONT Thomas Allen, son of Joseph Allen and Ruth his wife (Dec'd) of Shanandoah County and state of Virginia, Betty Lupton, Daughter of Samuel an d Sarah Lupton of Frederick Co. in  State afforsaid; 9th of the 5th month, 1792; at their 
2 CONC usual meeting house, the Ridge school house.
2 CONT
2 CONT _____________________________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT Betty witnessed marriage of Goldsmith Chandless and Eunice Allen; 6-12-1811; School house near Smith's Creek
2 CONT
2 CONT Betty witnessed marriage of John George and Leah Bond; 12-24-1828; Upper Ridge
2 CONT
