2 CONT
2 CONT -Hopewell MM on 9 May 1792 Thomas Allen, son of Joseph & Ruth, dec'd, of Shenandoah co,VA, marries at the Ridge School House, Betty Lupton, dau of Samuel & Sarah, of Frederick co,VA
2 CONT
2 CONT -Hopewell MM on 2 Jul 1792 Thomas & hw Betty granted certificate to Crooked Run MM
2 CONT
