1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Entry in Hopewell Friends History; 1734-1934; Frederick County, Virginia; pg. 309
2 CONT
2 CONT Jesse George, son of Elis George and  Lydia His wife,in the county of Hampshire and the State of Virginia, and Mercy Lupton, daughter of Isaac and  Eliz.. his wife of the same place; 14th day of the first month, 1795; at a meeting
2 CONC  appointed in Hampshire county. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Link''': https://books.google.com/books?id=pmMI8LrxfvMC&lpg=PA347&ots=qiCjub2tdh&dq=john%20lupt
2 CONT
2 CONT -------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT . Isaac, b. 11/7m/1748; m. 17/3m/1774 Elizabeth KIRK[49] Their daughter Mercy m. 14/1m/1795 Jesse GEORGE, son of "Elis and Lydia" (Lewis) George, at a meeting appointed in Hampshire Co., Va. Lydia had been disowned from Exeter Mo.
2 CONC  Mtg. because she "hath married a person not a member of our society." Later she acknowledged her outgoing and was reinstated. Jesse eventually joined Friends. Jesse and Mercy with their six oldest children migrated to Highland Co
2 CONC ., Ohio, in 1804.
2 CONT
2 CONT Link: http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~paxson/lupton/cit-lupton.html#44lup
2 CONT
2 CONT ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Jesse d. July 21, 1809, Omi, Fall Creek, Highland Co., Ohio, & burial was at Fall Creek Quaker cemetery. In October of 1839, Mercy George was granted a cert. of transfer from Fall Creek MM, Highland co., Ohio to Fairfield MM, near
2 CONC  Canby, Hendricks co., Indiana, received May 14, 1840. Mercy George & her family went on to Marion co. (Some of the children may have migrated to Marion co., Iowa & then to Jefferson co., Iowa) See Deed record Book 10, pg’s 241 & 
2 CONC 499/501.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Link''':http://www.genealogy.com/ftm/g/i/l/Margaret-A-Gilmore/WEBSITE-0001/UHP-0216.html
2 CONT
2 CONT Note on Mercy Lupton: some records show death date as Aug. 6th. Unable to verify
2 CONT
2 CONT D. Glenn-2015
2 CONT
