2 CONT ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Biography'''
2 CONT
2 CONT .SOLOMON4 LUPTON (WILLIAM3, WILLIAM2, JOSEPH1) was born November 05, 1780 in Frederick Co., VA., and died November 1848 in Jay County, IN..He married RACHEL WOOD September 22, 1803 in Short Creek Meeting, OH., daughter of JOSEPH W
2 CONC OOD and RACHEL. 
2 CONT       Children of SOLOMON LUPTON and RACHEL WOOD are:  45.	i.	 	JOSEPH AMBROSE5 LUPTON, b. June 25, 1807, Highland Co., OH.; d. December 29, 1870, Jay County, IN..
2 CONT  	ii.	 	LYDIA LUPTON, b. Highland Co., OH.; m. ANTRIM, 1826. 46.	iii.	 	GRACE POPE LUPTON, b. October 04, 1811, Champaing Co., OH.; d. November 07, 1836. 47.	iv.	 	RACHEL LUPTON, b. 1819, Highland Co., OH.; d. July 24, 1844.
2 CONT  	v.	 	MARGARET LUPTON, b. Highland Co., OH.; m. DEVER, 1836.
2 CONT  	vi.	 	ELIZABETH MCPHERSON LUPTON, b. June 23, 1819, Highland Co., OH.; m. AMOS GRISSELL, February 11, 1841.
2 CONT  	vii.	 	REBECCA LUPTON, b. 1819, Highland Co., OH.. 48.	viii.	 	WILLIAM DARIUS LUPTON, b. December 13, 1825, Highland Co., OH.; d. November 16, 1878, Schuyler Co., IL..
2 CONT  	ix.	 	ANN LUPTON, b. Abt. 1827, Highland Co., OH.; d. June 17, 1852
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Link''': http://www.genealogy.com/ftm/r/i/f/Bonnie-J-Riffel/GENE3-0004.html
2 CONT
