1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Not sure if there was an Isaac and Johnathan Isaac Lupton, sons of William and Bathsheba.
2 CONT
2 CONT Isaac Lupton m. Catherine Lupton March 17, 1831, Tippecanoe County, In (per Indiana State marriages). I believe she was the widow of one of his brothers. Perhaps Baker is her maiden name?
2 CONT
2 CONT I do show that Isaac Lupton had a brother, Jonathan, b. 1787, married 1 Feb 1814 to Catherine Stephens, married in Clinton Co., Ohio. I have no other info re Jonathan. According to Hopewell MM, Va, Jonathan Lupton was dis., mcd, 2
2 CONC 7 Aug 1814.
2 CONT
