1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Born September, 1801 at Hampshire County, West Virginia, the seventh of seven children born to Asa Lupton and Hannah Hanke.
2 CONT
2 CONT Aria was murdered  March 10, 1810, at 3 years of age.  Unable to find any details other than a poem under his profile in FamilySearch pedigree chart. This can be seen on the source page.
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: I periodically would search for info on the incident resulting in the murder of young Arial and one lucky day found the info. that had eluded me so long.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Boston Magazine; Vol. 3'''
2 CONT
2 CONT On Sunday, the10th ,  while the family of Mr. Asa Lupton, Hampshire county Vir., were expecting three children at meeting, a young man named Isaiah Martin,entered the house, broke open a chest of drawers and then to conceal his gu
2 CONC ilt added infinitely more to his atrocity by murdering the children. Some hopes are entertained that the eldest, a girl about 8 years of age, may recover- intended by Providence, perhaps to prove the villain's guilt. A person answ
2 CONC ering the description of Martin has been taken up at Baltimore 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Link'': 'http://books.google.com/books?id=7r1DAQAAMAAJ&pg=PA95&lpg=PA95&dq=murdered+child+of+asa+lupton&source
2 CONT
2 CONT added by D, Glenn
