2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''Location of Quaker Cemetery, near Capon Bridge'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Located Lat:39°15.299N; Lon:078°30.583W. or 39.255001 -78.509788
2 CONT
2 CONT Head west out of Capon Bridge on Rt 50. Make a left onto Dillions Run Road, about 3 miles, you will come to a dirt road with a small wooden sign "The Quaker Cemetery." Make a right down the road, stay to the left, and the cemetery
2 CONC  will be on the right about .8 of a mile. [update: If this road is closed you may have to take the next road south and go through the development until it joins with the cemetery road.]
2 CONT
2 CONT Cemetery Listing
2 CONT
2 CONT Lydia Horseman: died Mar 6, 1852; "Memory of" "Consort of William Horsement".
2 CONT
2 CONT William Horseman: born Aug 1782; died Jun 1872; "in the 90 year of his life".
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Link''': http://www.historichampshire.org/cems/quaker.htm
