1 NOTE {geni:about_me} D272 JOHN SKELTON 5 DENNY (same as above)  was born in Martinsville, Ind., Feb. 27, 1855. They moved to  Lincoln, Ill., where he married Dec. 23, 1875, Laura B. Wise,  born in 1859. In 1887, Mr. Denny moved his fam
2 CONC ily to Denver,  Colo. He died, in Delta, Colo., Apr. 2, 1925. Mrs. Denny lives  near Olympia, Wash. She has the Family Bible. 
