2 CONT
2 CONT Since there was not much of a way to earn a living in Ord in 1887, [Wm. A. and Elizabeth Anne] decided to move to California.  My mother had said that one of Grandpa's brothers was in San Francisco and they headed there.  In going
2 CONC  over the list of Grandpa's brothers and sisters I can not find any that were alive in that year except his brother Frank. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Addendum: Have just been looking over the old photos and find that one of Grandpa's brothers (half brother) was Eldrige G. born 8/11/1843 and no other information.  I had thought I remembered Mother saying it was her uncle Ed in S
