2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT William Hallett was born in December 1616 in Bridgeport, Dorset, England, the fourth of five known children and only son of Richard and Agnes Alford Hallett.
2 CONT In August 1649, when he was in his mid-thirties, he married Elizabeth Fones.[1] She bore him two known children, both sons:
2 CONT William Hallett
2 CONT Samuel Hallett.
2 CONT In 1657, when he was in his early forties, he married Susannah Booth .
2 CONT in 1668, when he was in his early fifties, he married Rebecca Baylies.
2 CONT On 17 April 1706, when he was eighty-nine, he died in Newtown, Queens, New York, of unknown causes.
2 CONT Name
