2 CONT William Hallett Memorial
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: 	1615 Dorset, England Death: 	Apr. 17, 1706 Astoria Queens County New York, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT May have been born in 1616.
2 CONT
2 CONT Town in England should be spelled Bridgeport.
2 CONT
2 CONT Died at Hallett's Cove, his home, which is now part of the town of Astoria.
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents:
2 CONT
2 CONT Richard Hallett and Alice Alford
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Elizabeth Fones in May 1647 in New Amsterdam,( New York City). He was her third husband.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had two sons William Jr. who married Sarah Woolsey and Samuel
2 CONT
2 CONT After Elizabeth's death William married Susannah (Booth) Thorne, the widow of William Thorne
2 CONT
2 CONT Other related families of the Hallett's were the Blackwell's, Berrien's and Rikers
2 CONT
