2 CONT Brief Life History of Rose
2 CONT
2 CONT When Rose Thorne was born in 1660, in Dartmouth, Bristol, Plymouth Colony, British Colonial America, her father, William Thorne, was 39 and her mother, Rose, was 34. She married Nathaniel Soule Sr in 1680, in Plymouth Colony, Brit
2 CONC ish Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 1 daughter. She died after 19 April 1726, in Dartmouth, Bristol, Massachusetts, United States.
2 CONT
