2 CONT ----
2 CONT Rose Thorn was born about 1660 at Duxbury in the Plymouth Colony and  died on 15 May 1702 at Dartmouth, Bristol, Massachusetts, “in her 104th year.” She is seen as a daughter of William Thorn.  She was the wife of Nathaniel Soule.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT She and Nathaniel Soule were married about 1680, most probably at Duxbury. Their first child, also Nathaniel, was born 12 Jan 1681.
2 CONT
2 CONT From https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Thorn-50
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children 
2 CONT
2 CONT #Nathaniel Soule (1681 - bef. 1766)
2 CONT #Sylvanus Soule Sr (abt. 1683 - aft. 1761)
2 CONT #Jacob Soule (abt. 1687 - abt. 1747)
2 CONT #Miles Soule (abt. 1690 - bef. 1740)
2 CONT
2 CONT The following children are no longer accepted by the Mayflower Society as children of  https://www.geni.com/people/Nathaniel-Soule-Sr/6000000001098871629 & https://www.geni.com/people/Rose-Soule/6000000001560073195?through=6000000
2 CONC 001560073263 and have been detached.
2 CONT
2 CONT *Mary Soule https://www.geni.com/people/Mary-Shrieve/6000000001560073263?through=6000000001098871629 parents unknown 
2 CONT *Susannah Soule https://www.geni.com/people/Susannah-Oliver/6000000001560068564?through=6000000001560073263 parents unknown 
2 CONT * https://www.geni.com/people/Sarah-Wheaton/6000000001560073218?through=6000000001560073195 shows as the daughter of George Soule Jr and Deborah Unknown
2 CONT
