1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 2. William Thorne was born about 1636 in Lynn, Essex, MA. He died about 1699 in New York. Presumably in Hempstead, LI, NY
2 CONT
2 CONT He was married to Winnifred Linnington (daughter of Henry Linnington) on 4 Sep 1662. Winnifred Linnington died in 1713. She was buried on 20 Feb 1713 in Grace Church, Flushing. William Thorne and Winnifred Linnington had the follo
2 CONC wing children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT +7 i. William Thorne. 
2 CONT
2 CONT +8 ii. John Thorne. 
2 CONT
2 CONT +9 iii. Elizabeth Thorne. 
2 CONT
2 CONT +10 iv. Hannah Thorne. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 11 v. Denton Thorne was born about 1673. He died about 1698. 
2 CONT
2 CONT +12 vi. Richard Thorne. 
2 CONT
2 CONT +13 vii. Sarah Thorne. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 14 viii. Abraham Thorne was born about 1681. The name of Abraham Thorne appears on the muster roll of Capt Joshua Cornell's, Dutchess Co., militia. 
2 CONT
2 CONT +15 ix. Margaret Thorne. 
2 CONT
2 CONT +16 x. Joseph Thorn.
2 CONT
