1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Elizabeth was the daughter of John Thorne (about 1643-1709) and Mary Pearsall Thorne (about 1649-1709). She was one of 9 children, born in 1664 or 1673 in Flushing, Queens Co. or New Rochelle, Westchester Co., New 
2 CONC York. 
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1692 she was joined in marriage to Anthony Badgley (1660-1715). She MAY have also been married to a man with the last name Hendley, and to a Frederick Schuerman **.
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth & Anthony were the parents of: George 1688-?, George Anthony, Sr. 1693-1759 whose memorial is #35700607, Anthony 1695-1732, Phebe 1696-1715, Sarah 1696-1785, Cornelius 1697-?, Phoebe 1698-1776, James 1699-1777, John 1700
2 CONC -1759, Sarah 1700-1785, and Elizabeth "Betsey" 1702-1733.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her burial location is currently unknown,  but she may be buried next to her  husband, in a family cemetery on private  property in Bidwell, Gallia County, Ohio.
2 CONT
2 CONT ~  ~  ~  ~  ~  ~  ~  ~  ~  ~  ~  ~  ~  ~  ~  ~  ~  ~  ~  ~
2 CONT
2 CONT **The following sent by member Robert Behrens. Details provided in the book "Schuremans of New York", Compiled by Richard Wynkoop, The Knickerbocker Press, New York, 1903, provides details of marriage of Elizabeth Thorne, daughter
2 CONC  of John Thorn and his wife Mary (Pearsall). This document states that John Thorn of Flushing, Queens, in his Will dated January 5, 1697, proved July 23, 1709, mentions his wife Mary, and, among other children, Elizabeth Schuerman
2 CONC .
2 CONT
2 CONT This book also provides evidence that for the return of their minister, dated June 1, 1743, addressed to the Episcopal Society of the Propagation of the Gospel, is Affixed Frederick Schuerman's mark that they have four children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Margret, aged 18 in 1710 Susanna, aged 15, 1in 1710 Elizabeth, aged 13 in 1710 Isabell, aged 4, in 1710.
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/71181479/elizabeth-badgley Find A Grave Memorial] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Apr 27 2020, 17:33:44 UTC''
