2 CONT Rachel married Jacob Laing Sr. son of David Laing and Mary Thorne on 24 May 1780 in Plainfield Monthly Meeting, Somerset, New Jersey. Jacob was born in 1747 in Plainfield/Woodbridge, Middlesex Co., New Jersey. He died 3 on 25 Nov 
2 CONC 1821 in Piscataway, Middlesex Co., New Jersey. 
2 CONT
2 CONT [Notes]  They had the following children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT i Mary Laing was born on 5 Jul 1781. She died date unknown.  
2 CONT
2 CONT ii David Laing was born on 23 Oct 1783. He died prob 19 4mo 1855. [Notes]  
2 CONT
2 CONT iii Abraham Laing
2 CONT
2 CONT iv Nancy Laing was born on 11 Jul 1788. She died on 23 Feb 1852 in Plainfield, Union Co., New Jersey. She was buried in Plainfield Friends Cem, Plainfield, Union Co., New Jersey.  
2 CONT
2 CONT v Phebe Laing was born on 5 Jul 1790. She died date unknown.  
2 CONT
2 CONT vi Jacob Laing Jr. was born on 28 Aug 1792. He died date unknown.  
2 CONT
2 CONT vii Rachel Laing was born on 26 Jan 1795. She died date unknown.  
2 CONT
2 CONT viii Joseph Laing was born on 22 Jul 1798. He died date unknown.  
