2 CONT https://ancestors.familysearch.org/en/LR1R-JJD/ethalenah-carpenter-1667-1774
2 CONT
2 CONT Ethalenah Carpenter
2 CONT Female
2 CONT about 1667–27 December 1774
2 CONT •
2 CONT
2 CONT Brief Life History of Ethalenah
2 CONT
2 CONT When Ethalenah Carpenter was born about 1667, in Providence, Providence, Rhode Island, United States, her father, Timothy Carpenter, was 25 and her mother, Hannah Burton, was 16. She married Daniel Sweet about 1683, in East Greenw
2 CONC ich, Kent, Rhode Island, United States. They were the parents of at least 6 sons and 3 daughters. She died on 27 December 1774, in Glocester, Providence, Rhode Island, United States, at the age of 108.
