2 CONT Searching for any information CLARK,Robert P., married Cora Dixon Steuben county NY 1902.  Father CLARK, Peter married Nancy Gorton. I think Robert Clark had a brother Charles and sister Edith;of Steuben Co (Corning) NY. Dotty Sch
2 CONC midt (e-mail updated: 3/28/02)
