2 CONC b. 1697 Providence, Providence, RI d. January 27, 1781 Scituate, Providence, RI} and Amity Harris {b. October 10, 1697 Providence, Providence, RI d. May 05, 1769 Scituate, Providence, RI}. Amity Harris is the daughter of Richard H
2 CONC arris {24703} and Elizabeth King {24703}. Here's why I think so: Rufus and Nancy (Whipple) Smith have children named Richard, Lydia C., and Amity. Their other children are apparently named for Nancy's family--Stephen, Mary, and Zi
2 CONC ba. The location (Scituate, RI) and ages of the individuals are appropriate as well." Parents: Richard was the son of Thomas Harris (1641-1711) and Elnatha Tew (1644-1711).  
