1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Accounts say Mary's parents were https://www.geni.com/people/Edward-Pearson/6000000000921097336 (born 1648 in Pownall Fee, Cheshire, England; died June 3, 1697 in Bucks Co, Pennsylvania) and [https://www.geni.com/p
2 CONC eople/Sarah-Pierson/6000000006788784848 Sarah Burgis] (born April 14, 1651 in Pownall Fee, Cheshire, England.)
2 CONT
2 CONT Another says that her parents were Robert Pierson (born 1634 in Pownall-Fee, d. May 23 1674) and Mary Janney (b Mar 1626 in Pownall-Fee, d. Jan 1689 in Mobberley, Cheshire, England).
2 CONT
2 CONT The balance of the evidence points to  Edward and Sarah. 
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=45822637
