1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Rachel Elmira Pickering,daughter of Isacc Pickering and Grace Lupton
2 CONT Married Solomon Wright on 13 Jun 1787 in Bucks County,Pennsylvania.
2 CONT Children from this marriage were: 
2 CONT
2 CONT i.Joel Martin Wright was born in 1788 in Burke County, North Carolina,died on 29 Nov 1834 in McRoberts,Perry (now Letcher)County,Kentucky at age 46,and was buried in McRoberts,Perry (now Letcher)County,Kentucky. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ii.Solomon Jr. Wright was born in 1798 in Burke County,North Carolina and died on an unknown date. 
2 CONT
2 CONT iii.Jonathan Wesley Wright was born on 1 Mar 1801 in Burke County,North Carolina,died in 1889 in Dickenson County,Virginia at age 88,and was buried in John Kerr Cem.,Dickenson County,Virginia. 
2 CONT
2 CONT iv.Aaron Wright was born in 1803 in Burke County,North Carolina and died on an unknown date. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Aaron married Mary Biggs,daughter of Gray Biggs and Dolly Garland.Mary was born on an unknown date and died on an unknown date. 
2 CONT
2 CONT v.Swinfield Wright was born in 1813 in Burke County,North Carolina and died in 1858 at age 45. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Solomon next married Myra after 1813.Myra was born on an unknown date and died on an unknown date.
