2 CONT
2 CONT Grace Stackhouse was born July 27, 1727 in Bucks County, Pennsylvania, and died 1798 in Fredericks County, Virginia. She married Samuel II Pickering on December 30, 1747 in Bucks County, Pennsylvania.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Grace Stackhouse and Samuel II Pickering are:
2 CONT # Mary Pickering, b. August 30, 1748, Virginia, d. July 01, 1823, Ohio.
2 CONT # Jacob Pickering, b. April 09, 1750, Berkeley County, Virginia, d. February 28, 1832.
2 CONT # Benjamin Pickering, b. July 07, 1752, Bucks County, Pennsylvania, d. January 27, 1807, Tennessee.
2 CONT # Sarah Pickering, b. September 02, 1754, Bucks County, Pennsylvania, d. date unknown.
2 CONT # Samuel III Pickering, b. February 05, 1757, Bucks County, Pennsylvania, d. August 24, 1811, Belmont County, Ohio.
2 CONT # Isaac Pickering, b. May 12, 1759, Belmont County, Ohio, d. date unknown.
2 CONT # Jonathan Pickering, b. March 28, 1761, Fredericks County, Virginia, d. Bef. March 05, 1804.
2 CONT # John Pickering, b. July 16, 1763, Fredericks County, Virginia, d. Aft. 1839.
2 CONT # Grace Pickering, b. November 05, 1765, Fredericks County, Virginia, d. 1829.
2 CONT # Mercy Pickering, b. December 28, 1767, Fredericks County, Virginia, d. date unknown.
2 CONT # Rachel Pickering, b. October 04, 1770, Fredericks County, Virginia, d. Aft. 1804.
2 CONT # Hannah Pickering, b. February 23, 1773, Fredericks County, Virginia, d. Aft. 1823, Ohio.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://familytreemaker.genealogy.com/users/s/w/a/Loring-Swain-nm/WEBSITE-0001/UHP-0254.html
