2 CONT Grace Stackhouse -61 was born 1729 in Bucks County, daughter of Benjamin Stackhouse and Sarah Gilbert, married Samuel Pickering, Oct 30, 1747. '''This Grace is documented in "The Stackhouse Family Book by A.M Stackhouse,MD 1907"''
