2 CONT More About William Pickering and Sarah Wright:
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage: 1749, Hopewell MM, Frederick County, VA
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Daughter of James & Mary Wright..She married William Pickering 1749..Bucks County,Pennsylvania
2 CONT
2 CONT Research Notes:He Married Sarah Wright 1749.Sarah Was born in Nottingham,Chester County,Pennsylvania May 15 1727.Sarah was the daughter of James Wright and Mary Davis.Sarah Died 1775 in Fredrick county,Virginia at 48 yrs of age..I
2 CONC t has been noted that William was rather well to do and as early as 1763 he deeded some land from Jesse Pugh..Went to the Quakers settlement in Fredrick County,Virginia in 1748 after the French-Indian War (1754-1763).He and his br
2 CONC other,Samual,Jr.,were members of Hopewell Monthly Meeting of Friends.Shortly before 1810 these Quakers families began moving to Belmont Ohio..
