1 NOTE {geni:about_me} When John Pickering was born on 23 February 1752, in Chester, Pennsylvania, British Colonial America, his father, William Pickering, was 32 and his mother, Sarah Wright, was 24. He married Jane Ellis in 1775, in Ha
2 CONC rtland, Clay, Virginia, United States. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 3 daughters. He died on 1 October 1796, in Hopewell MM, Frederick, Virginia, United States, at the age of 44, and was buried in Frederick, Virgini
2 CONC a, United States
2 CONT
2 CONT https://ancestors.familysearch.org/en/KZVK-JH2/john-pickering-1752-1796
2 CONT
2 CONT Born in Hopewell, Frederick, Virginia, USA on 23 Feb 1752 to Thomas Broom and Grace Stackhouse. John Pickering passed away on 1 Oct 1796 in Frederick, Virginia, USA.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/204509543/john-pickering
