2 CONT  ==will exrtract== ''3.277.  Stephen Twining, of Wrightstown, Yeoman. ''<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT *8th mo., 8th day, 1771.  Proved July 31, 1772.
2 CONT *Wife Margaret.  
2 CONT *Son Stephen, exr. 
2 CONT *Dau. Abigail Hillborn's children, viz., Samuel, Joseph, Mary, Elizabeth Hillborn, 50 acres of land in Springfield Twp. adj. land late Casper Wistars and James Logan.  
2 CONT *Her other children, John, Thomas, William and David Hillborn.  
2 CONT *Dau. Mary Chapman, widow of John Chapman, 50 acres in Springfield afsd. adj. Jacob Hooker, Abrm. Funk and John Moffit. 
2 CONT *Son Stephen, 100 acres in Wrightstown adj. Richard Mitchell, late Hugh Young and late John Chapman. 
2 CONT *Son-in-law Samuel Hillborn, dau. Margaret, wife of Thomas Hamilton and her children, 
2 CONT *grandsons Stephen, William and Joseph Kirk. 
2 CONT *Thomas Kirk son of Isaac and Rachel.
2 CONT **Wit: James Briggs, Junr., John Story, Junr., John Story.<br/>
2 CONT
