1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Marriage: Hopewell Friends History:
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Allen, son of Joseph Allen and Ruth his wife (Dec'd) of Shanandoah County and state of Virginia, Betty Lupton, Daughter of Samuel an d Sarah Lupton of Frederick Co. in State afforsaid; 9th of the 5th month, 1792; at their u
2 CONC sual meeting house, the Ridge school house.
2 CONT
2 CONT __________________________________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT -Hopewell MM, Frederick co,VA on 3 Apr 1775 Thomas mentioned along with siblings as received on request
2 CONT
2 CONT -Hopewell MM on 4 Aug 1788 Thomas, an apprentice, son of Joseph, received on certificate from Crooked Run MM
2 CONT
2 CONT -Hopewell MM on 9 May 1792 Thomas Allen, son of Joseph & Ruth, dec'd, of Shenandoah co,VA, marries at the Ridge School House, Betty Lupton, dau of Samuel & Sarah, of Frederick co,VA
2 CONT
2 CONT -Hopewell MM on 2 Jul 1792 Thomas & hw Betty granted certificate to Crooked Run MM
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Link''':https://books.google.com/books?id=pmMI8LrxfvMC&pg=PA299&dq=betty+lupton+married+thomas+allen&hl=en&sa=X&ei=A5uOVbD-PIjEggSFp7e4Dw&ved=0CBgQ6AEwAQ#v=onepage&q=betty%20lupton%20married%20thoma
2 CONT
