1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/205428805/jesse-george
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Entry in Hopewell Friends History; 1734-1934; Frederick County, Virginia; pg. 309
2 CONT
2 CONT Jesse George, son of Elis George and  Lydia His wife,in the county of Hampshire and the State of Virginia, and Mercy Lupton, daughter of Isaac and  Eliz.. his wife of the same place; 14th day of the first month, 1795; at a meeting
2 CONC  appointed in Hampshire county. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Link''': https://books.google.com/books?id=pmMI8LrxfvMC&lpg=PA347&ots=qiCjub2tdh&dq=john%20lupt
2 CONT
2 CONT ________________________________________________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT Jesse George (son of Ellis George and Lydia Lewis) was born Abt. 1770 in Berks Pennsylvania (Now WVA), and died 21 Jul 1809 in Rainsboro, Highland Co., Ohio.He married Mercy Lupton on 14 Jan 1795, daughter of Isaac Lupton and Eliz
2 CONC abeth Kirk.
2 CONT  Notes for Jesse George: Jesse George  b. c1770, in Berks Pennsylvania and migrated to Hampshire co., Virginia with the family in 1778. m. January 14, 1795, Mercy "Mary" Lupton, b. c July 3, 1777, the [oldest child] daughter of Is
2 CONC aac & Elizabeth ( Kirk) Lupton, of Hampshire co., Virginia. They lived in Hampshire co. until they migrated to Highland co., Ohio in October, arriving in December of 1804. They were the first of the George family to locate in Ohio
2 CONC  and would be followed in 1805 by his brother in law & sister, Jonathan & Rachel Barrett. The rest of the family would not come to Ohio until 1830. Jesse d. July 21, 1809, Omi, Fall Creek, Highland Co., Ohio, & burial was at Fall 
2 CONC Creek Quaker cemetery. In October of 1839, Mercy George was granted a cert. of transfer from Fall Creek MM, Highland co., Ohio to Fairfield MM, near Canby, Hendricks co., Indiana, received May 14, 1840. Mercy George & her family w
2 CONC ent on to Marion co. (Some of the children may have migrated to Marion co., Iowa & then to Jefferson co., Iowa) See Deed record Book 10, pg’s 241 & 499/501.
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Link''':http://www.genealogy.com/ftm/g/i/l/Margaret-A-Gilmore/WEBSITE-0001/UHP-0216.html
2 CONT
2 CONT Added by D. Glenn
2 CONT
