1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT "By her marriage to Joseph Starbuck, Grace Lupton had three children, two living in 1887. After Grace's death, Joseph Starbuck married her sister, Rebecca Lupton. After the death of Joseph Starbuck in 1844, Rachel Ann and Grace P.
2 CONC  Starbuck were taken to live with Grace Lupton's parents, Solomon and Rachel Lupton. The girls remained with the Luptons until the grandparents death. Grandmother Lupton died in 1846, Grandfather Lupton died in 1848. After the gra
2 CONC ndparents deaths, the girls lived with an Uncle until they married."
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: History of Jay County, Indiana;  Cecil Beeson
