2 CONT The same page lists their children with dates of birth {Hinshaw lists months and days in addition to the years listed here):
2 CONT
2 CONT Ann, 1806, 3, 18
2 CONT William, 1806, 1, 21 (typo; should be 1808) Jane, 1810, 1, 23 John, 1812, 7, 14 Lydia, 1814, 9, 22 Mary, 1817, 3, 4 Ruth, 1819, 6, 18 Grace, 1821, 11, 19
2 CONT
2 CONT =====
2 CONT
2 CONT Hinshaw, vol. V, p. 96, in records of Miami Monthly Meeting, notes that Isaac & wife Betty and daughter Ann were received in 1807 on a certificate from Hopewell MM, dated 1806.
