2 CONT Elizabeth of Baltimore Md daughter Isaac & Elizabeth McPherson of same place marry 16-5-1810 at Baltimore meetinghouse WD Md Jonathan JANNEY of Loudon Co Va son Israel & 2nd wife Ann (PLUMMER) Janney of Loudon Co Va who was grante
2 CONC d certificate to Baltimore monthly meeting WD Md by Goose Creek monthly meeting Loudon Co Va 29-3-1810 to marry her; remove removed here with husband she was received on certificate from Baltimore monthly meeting WD Md 30-8-1810 d
2 CONC ated 8-8-1810 her certificate being in the name Elizabeth (McPHERSON) Janney wife Jonathan Janney (See JANNEY)
2 CONT
