1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Daughter of Isaac and Elizabeth (Lupton) McPherson, she would marry John T. Barrick, founder of the town of Janesville, Iowa. It is said he named his town after his wife. She was kindly woman, and was very popular 
2 CONC with the citizens of Janesville. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Isaac and Jane Barrick:
2 CONT
2 CONT # John BARRICK b: 1841 in Ohio
2 CONT
2 CONT #  Isaac BARRICK b: 25 JAN 1834 in Highland County, Ohio
2 CONT
