2 CONC etery book, 1972 edition, p. 124, lists her date of birth as Mar. 3, 1806, so that must be on one of the tombstones. The McBrides report that there are two tombstones, one saying she was born Mar.3,1806, and died Dec.1, 1830, and 
2 CONC another saying she died 1st d 12th mo 1830 at age 24yrs 9mos. Pike-2301 00:21, 16 October 2015 (EDT)
