1 NOTE {geni:about_me}  Moorman Johnson, Green & Highland, Ohio By Lem Guthery
2 CONT
2 CONT Generation No. 2
2 CONT
2 CONT        2.James Seneca Johnston, born 1742; died 1820 in Leesburg, Highland Co., Ohio.He was the son of 4. John Johnston and 5. Elizabeth Ellyson.He married 3. Penelope Anthony.
2 CONT        3.Penelope Anthony, born Ca. 21 Feb 1747 in Louisa County, Virginia; died 1820 in Leesburg, Highland Co., Ohio.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of James Johnston and Penelope Anthony are:
2 CONT *    i.       Moorman Johnson, born 1760; married Elizabeth Moorman.
2 CONT *    ii.       Christopher Johnston, born 1761.
2 CONT *    iii.       Elizabeth Johnson, born 1767.
2 CONT *   iv.       Sarah Johnson, born 1769.
2 CONT
2 CONT  *  v.       John Johnson, born 1771; married Dorothy Crew.
2 CONT *   vi.       Joseph Johnson, born 1772; died 1838; married Betsy Butterworth Ballard      
2 CONT
2 CONT *  vii.       James A. Johnston, born May 1774; died 19 Apr 1845 in Fairfield, Highland Co., Ohio; married Mildred Pate; born 1784 in Virginia; died Oct 1860.
2 CONT *  viii.       Jesse Johnson, born 1776; died 1845; married Mary Burgess.
2 CONT
2 CONT *    ix.       Judith Johnson, born 1778; died 1863.
2 CONT  *  x.       Mary Johnson, born 1781.
2 CONT  *  xi.       Penelope Johnson, born 1783; married Joseph C Burgess.
2 CONT *  xii.       Anthony Johnson, born 1785; married Mary Lupton.
2 CONT  *  xiii.       Jonothan Johnson, born 1787; died 1863.
2 CONT
2 CONT *   xiv.       Rachel Johnson, born 1789; married Allen Lupton.
2 CONT
2 CONT Link: http://www.genealogy.com/forum/surnames/topics/johnson/27637/
