2 CONC 5-19), Lydia (1817- ) and Sidney Ann (1820-1911). Hezekiah's second wife was Edith Lupton Adams [memorial #107721933] whom he married in 1828. She was  the widow of Joseph Adams, with whom she had had 5 children, including Mary Ja
2 CONC ne Adams [memorial #107367264]. Hezekiah and Edith had 2 children: David (1830-38) and William R. [memorial #91102840]. In 1846 Hezekiah married Williamina Rice and had 1 child, Seth James (1847- ).* Reference: [https://www.findag
