1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 10.WILLIAM4 LUPTON (JESSE3, WILLIAM2, JOSEPH1) was born February 15, 1787 in Hampshire Co., W. VA., and died October 04, 1861 in Highland Co., OH..He married MARY BARRETT October 13, 1813 in Hampshire Co., W. VA., 
2 CONC daughter of JOHN BARRETT and RHONDA TAYLOR. 
2 CONT
2 CONT       Children of WILLIAM LUPTON and MARY BARRETT are: 
2 CONT
2 CONT * 27.	i.  ISAAC5 LUPTON, b. 1818, Hampshire Co., W. VA..
2 CONT * ii.	    RACHEL LUPTON, b. June 09, 1814, Hampshire Co., W. VA.; d. February 07, 1863, Highland Co., OH.; m. PETER OATS.
2 CONT * iii.	    WILLIAM JR. LUPTON.
2 CONT * 28.	iv. RHODA LUPTON, b. October 24, 1820.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source''': Genealogy Report: Descendants of Joseph Lupton
2 CONT
