1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From: Genealogy Report: Descendants of Absolom Yonally:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.ABSOLOM1 YONALLY was born August 10, 1798 in Frederick Co., Virginia, and died February 16, 1882 in Union Twp., Belmont Co., Ohio.He married (1) REBECCA LUPTON Abt. 1814 in Virginia, daughter of JESSE LUPTON and REBECCA GEORGE.S
2 CONC he was born Abt. 1795 in Virginia, and died Bet. 1841 - 1848 in Belmont Co., Ohio.He married (2) MARGARET DONOHUE November 01, 1848 in Belmont Co., Ohio.She died 1853 in Belmont Co., Ohio.He married (3) NAOMI HOWELL Aft. 1853 in B
2 CONC elmont Co., Ohio, daughter of ABEL HOWELL and NAOMI REED.She was born December 16, 1812 in Flushing Twp., Belmont Co., Ohio, and died February 05, 1904 in Union Twp., Belmont Co., Ohio. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of ABSOLOM YONALLY and REBECCA LUPTON are: 
2 CONT
2 CONT * 2.	i.	 	LYDIA2 YONALLY, b. July 05, 1816, Hampshire Co., Virginia; d. February 28, 1899.
2 CONT * 3.	ii.	 	LEWIS YONALLY, b. August 09, 1820, Hampshire Co., Virginia; d. February 14, 1897, Noble Co., Elk Twp., Ohio.
2 CONT * iii.	 	SARAH YONALLY, b. December 1824, Virginia; d. Unknown; m. JAMES HUMPHREY, February 08, 1848, Belmont Co., Ohio; b. March 1827, Belmont Co., Wheeling Twp., Ohio; d. 1894, Belmont Co., Ohio.
2 CONT  	Notes for SARAH YONALLY: 1900 Census Records, Belmont County, Ohio 
2 CONT       James Humphrey born March 1827 in Wheeling Twp., Belmont Co., Ohio. 
2 CONT       Sarahborn December 1824 in Virginia     
2 CONT       3. ch, 3, live, 
2 CONT       Mar., 55 yr. 
2 CONT * 4.	iv.	 	JESSE YONALLY, b. March 11, 1825, Harrison Co., Ohio; d. December 27, 1887, Dickinson Co., Kansas.
2 CONT * 5.	v.	 	REBECCA W. YONALLY, b. October 05, 1828, Harrison Co., Ohio; d. April 10, 1913, Kennon, Flushing Twp., Belmont Co., Ohio.
2 CONT * 6.	vi.	 	DAVID YONALLY, b. May 10, 1831, Harrison Co., Cadiz Twp., Ohio; d. June 28, 1909, Harrison Co., Cadiz Twp., Ohio.
2 CONT * 7.	vii.	 	ASA YONALLY, b. April 21, 1833, Harrison Co., Cadiz Twp., Ohio; d. February 06, 1880, Washington Co., Ohio.
2 CONT * 8.	viii.	 	SOLOMON YONALLY, b. December 27, 1835, Belmont Co., Ohio; d. August 31, 1895, Manchester, Dickinson Co., Kansas.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of ABSOLOM YONALLY and MARGARET DONOHUE is: 
2 CONT
2 CONT * 9.	ix.	 	MARY2 YONALLY, b. Abt. 1852, Belmont Co., Union Twp.,, Ohio; d. Unknown.
2 CONT
