1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *========================== From [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=57731431 FindAGrave memorial]:  Civil War Veteran
2 CONT ************** Tombstone Inscription: Age 65 years, 3 months, 16 days.  Nancy E., His Wife.  Born November 27, 1837.
2 CONT ************** Jesse & Nancy were married 17 February 1859 in Noble Co., Ohio. Jesse was the son of Absolom Yonally and Rebecca Lupton. Jess and Nancy had eleven children.
2 CONT ************** Jesse born 11 March 1822 ?? died December 1887. Jesse & Solomon Yonally of Dickinson County, Kansas were brothers. There is speculation that Jesse was an adopted son. This has not been proven.
2 CONT *==========================
