1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Franklin Evening Star Franklin, Indiana June 18, 1928
2 CONT
2 CONT TWO DEATHS IN BURTON FAMILY ARE REPORTED
2 CONT
2 CONT EDINBURG, June 18.---Charles Burton received a telegram Friday announcing the death of his father at Campbellsburg, Ky., who had committed suicide. Ill health was said to have been the cause of his act. Charles Burton and wife lef
2 CONC t immediately for that place.
2 CONT
2 CONT W. T. Burton, cousin of Charles Burton, also received a message Friday evening announcing the death of Charles Bryant, who was drowned near Columbus, Ky. Just five years ago, June 5th, his son was drowned in Kentucky.
