2 CONT
2 CONT When Morris Thomas was born from about 1719 to 1727, in Chester, Pennsylvania, British Colonial America, his father, Rev Owen Thomas, was 36 and his mother, Eleanor, was 37. He married Mary Cantrell. They were the parents of at le
2 CONC ast 7 sons and 5 daughters. He lived in London Britain Township, Chester, Pennsylvania, British Colonial America in 1741 and Hampshire, Virginia, United States for about 5 years. He died on 10 January 1793, in Hardy, Virginia, Uni
2 CONC ted States.
2 CONT
