1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From the Chaffee Genealogy:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.archive.org/stream/chaffeegenealogy01chaf/chaffeegenealogy01chaf_djvu.txt
2 CONT
2 CONT Stephen & Chaffee (James,* Joseph, 3 Joseph, ^ Thomas i) was 
2 CONT *born in Woodstock, Conn., September 25, 1773, and 
2 CONT *died in Springville, N. Y., February 6, 1841. 
2 CONT *He married in Woodstock, in 1795, Ruth, daughter of Kingsley Underwood of Vermont, a relative of Judge Underwood of Virginia. At the time of their marriage she lived in Woodstock, and he in Brimfield, Mass. She was born November 
2 CONC 17, 1774, and died August 8, 1840, at the home of her daughter, Ruby (Chaffee) Baker, in Evans, N. Y., where she was buried. 
2 CONT *Stephen Chaffee was baptized in the First Congregational Church in Woodstock, November 5, 1773. 
2 CONT *He and his wife were both members of the Methodist church. 
2 CONT *He had a light complexion, black eyes and was five feet, ten inches in height. 
2 CONT *February 6, 1795, he and his wife, being then of Pittsford, Vt., sold for £28, to John Fox of Woodstock, all their right and title, in the real estate of Daniel Underwood, deceased, the property being in Woodstock. 
2 CONT *Between 1798 and 1804 Stephen Chaffee moved from Vermont to Cazenovia, N. Y., and about 1810 to Attica, N. Y. 
2 CONT *He was a farmer. 
2 CONT *He went to live with his son Ambrose W. Chaffee in Springville after the death of his wife, but he survived her loss only six months. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children : 
2 CONT *802 i Lucy Chaffee, born February 17, 1790; died January 11, 1859; married John Buck, and lived near Attica. 
2 CONT *+ 803 ii Amasa Ladd Chaffee, born November 28, 1797; married Lydia W. Nichols. 
2 CONT *804 iii David Kingsley Chaffee, born January 18, 1800; died; married and moved to a place near Warren, Ohio. 
2 CONT *805 iv James Chaffee, born December 26, 1801; died July 4, 1803. 
2 CONT *+ 806 V James Cady Chaffee, born February 22, 1804; married Lucy A. Chaffee (1988).
2 CONT *807 vi Ohver Bugbee Chaffee, born April 20, 1806; died in Attica; married and had children; residence, Attica. 
2 CONT *808 vii Ruby Underwood Chaffee, born April 23, 1808; married Sylvester Baker; residence in 1840, Evans, later Hudson, Mich. 
2 CONT *809 viii Alzina Chaffee, born December 18, 1810; died February 21, 1820. 
2 CONT *810 ix Ambrose Worthington Chaffee, born February 23, 1813; married Fluery; had a light complexion, black eyes, and was six feet in height; residence in 1841, Springville, later moved to Iowa. 
