2 CONT ##London Metropolitan Archives; London, England; Church of England Parish Registers, 1538-1812; Reference Number: P69/NIC1/A/001/MS17621. By subscription image 101 at: https://www.ancestry.com/interactive/1624/31281_a102193-00105?
2 CONC pid=7927222.
2 CONT ##The American Genealogist 16:95-101 $ subscription, Accessed 4 Mar 2019
2 CONT ## Delafield, John Ross.. Delafield : the family history. Privately printed, 1945, Vol II, Appendix 16, p 545 note contains the will of Judith's father names her and James Feake as well as mentioning court action
2 CONT ## Horace Wilbur Palmer, Palmer families in America, (Neshanic NJ: Neshanic Print Co., 1966), Internet Archive, p 15. [1]
2 CONT ## The Genealogy of Walter Gilbert Title: The Genealogy of Walter Gilbert, Ancestors: The Tenth Generation Back, Robert Feake, Elizabeth Fones [2]
2 CONT ## McCracken, George E., The Feake Family of Norfolk, London, and Colonial America, NYGBR (NYGBS, 1955) Vol. 86, Page 143.
2 CONT ## Delafield, John. Delafield, The Family History (New York, 1945) Vol. 2, Page 545.
