1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT James Feake M, b. 13 February 1599, d. before 1625
2 CONT
2 CONT Father* James Feake b. c 1567, d. b 20 May 1625 Mother* Judith Thomas b. c 1575, d. b 24 Dec 1625
2 CONT
2 CONT      James was born on Saturday, 13 February 1599 at London, County Middlesex, England.1 He was the son of James Feake and Judith Thomas. He was a student at the Merchant Taylors' School 1609/1610.2 He was a goldsmith in London. J
2 CONC ames married Audrey Crompton on 14 June 1620 at St. Mary Mounthawe Church, London, County Middlesex, England.2 He and Audrey were blessed with 2 children. James departed this life before 1625 at London, County Middlesex, England. 
2 CONC It was about this time that his children went to live with their aunt Alice. Family:  Audrey Crompton d. b 1625 Children Judith Feake b. c 1621, d. a 9 Mar 1668 Tobias Feake+ b. b Aug 1624, d. b 8 Oct 1672
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations [S1079] George E. McCracken, The Feake Family of Norfolk, London, and Colonial America, page 145. [S1080] George E. McCracken, The Feake Family of Norfolk, London, and Colonial America, page 210.
