1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Elizabeth Fownes Winthrop was a cousin and widow of Henry Winthrop, son of Governor John Winthrop, said Henry losing his life by drowning shortly after his arrival in New England.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Son of Governor John Winthrop.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Henry Winthrop Memorial
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: 	Jan. 10, 1607 Suffolk, England Death: 	Jul. 2, 1630 Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT HENRY, 2nd known child of Gov. John & Mary (Forth) Winthrop, was born 10 January 1607/8 & baptized at Groton 19 January 1607/8. He married 25 April 1629 Elizabeth Fones & died at sea landing in New England. She married (2) ROBERT 
2 CONC FEAKE and then became the consort of William Hallett. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family links: 
2 CONT  Parents:
2 CONT   John Winthrop (1588 - 1649)
2 CONT   Mary Forth Winthrop (1583 - 1615)
2 CONT
2 CONT  Spouse:
2 CONT   Elizabeth Fones Winthrop Feake Hallett (1610 - 1673)*
2 CONT
2 CONT  Children:
2 CONT   Martha Johanna Winthrop Lyon (1630 - 1653)*
2 CONT
2 CONT  Siblings:
2 CONT   John Winthrop (1606 - 1676)**
2 CONT   Henry Winthrop (1607 - 1630)
2 CONT   Mary Winthrop Dudley (1609 - 1643)*
2 CONT   Female Infant Winthrop (1616 - 1616)**
2 CONT   Deane Winthrop (1623 - 1704)**
2 CONT   Ann Winthrop (1630 - 1631)**
2 CONT
2 CONT *Calculated relationship
2 CONT **Half-sibling
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: Body lost at sea
2 CONT
2 CONT Created by: Linda Mac Record added: Jul 24, 2010  Find A Grave Memorial# 55382640
