1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 15.SAMUEL HALLETT   8.WILLIAM HALLETT   6.RICHARD HALLETT    1.WILLIAM 
2 CONT
2 CONT HALLETT
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel Hallett, a son of William and Elizabeth (Fones) [Winthrop] {Feake} Hallett, was born about 1650 and died n Newtown, Queens County, NY in 1727.  He married Bridget Blackwell. She was born about 1655.
2 CONT
2 CONT Will of Samue Hallett:
2 CONT
2 CONT In the name of God, Amen. I, SAMUEL HALLETT, of Newtown, in Queens County, being sickly and weak. I leave to my daughters, Elizabeth Jackson, Grace Hewlett, Mercy Cornell, and Martha Hazzard, 2 horses, 2 cows, six yearlings, and 2
2 CONC 10 pounds which is due to me by the bond of John French, of NY, and 24 pounds due me from said John French and his son-in-law, Edward Earle, and also the produce of a certain horse now in the hands of Edmond Haynes, and all my hou
2 CONC sehold goods except a cedar chest and 4 pounds in the hands of my son, Samuel Hallett. All to be divided equally between them. I leave to my son Samuel, all the rest of my estate, real and personal, and he is to pay all debts. And
2 CONC  he is to pay 6 pounds to my granddaughters, Mary Cornell, Hannah Washburn, and Sarah Hazzard. I make my son Samuel, and my son-in-law, James Hazzard, executors.
2 CONT
2 CONT Dated October 7, 1716.
2 CONT
2 CONT Witnesses,
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph Hallett, Thomas Jones,Peter Berrian.
2 CONT
2 CONT Proved, May 16, 1727.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Samuel and Bridget (Blackwell) Hallett. 26.  (1). Samuel Jr.              b.       1678 27.  (2). Elizabeth       m.  John Jackson Jr. 28. (3). Hannah 29. (4). Grace 30. (5). Mercy 31. (6). Martha
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Actually born at Hallett's Cove, now a part of Astoria, Queens County, New York
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents:
2 CONT
2 CONT William Hallett and Elizabeth Fones
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife:  Bridget Blackwell
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT # Hannah married John Washburn
2 CONT # (Major) Samuel (Jr)
2 CONT # Elizabeth  married John Jackson
2 CONT # Grace  married Lewis Hewlett
2 CONT # Mercy  married ________ Cornell
2 CONT # Martha  married James Hazard
2 CONT
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/66837120/samuel-hallett Find A Grave Memorial] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jun 13 2020, 14:09:04 UTC''
