1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The Cox Family in America By Henry Miller Cox, George William Cocks, John 
2 CONT
2 CONT HANNAH (COCK) PRIAR (John*, James1) b. Matinecock, Long Island, N. Y., 23/8 mo (Oct) 1689; d. before 1760; m. Matthew Priar, b. Killingworth upon Matinecock 29/1 mo (Mar) 1690, son of John and Elizabeth (Bowne) Priar, of Killingwo
2 CONC rth. (See Appendix). They were farmers and Friends.
