2 CONT
2 CONT iii Matthew, b. 6/1 mo. (Mar.) 1728/9; m. ist 1754, Ann Pearsall. dau. of Henry and Mary (Titus) Pearsall, and widow Silas Willis ; m. 2d, 1789, Hannah53 Cock, dau. of Samuel21 and Martha (Ailing) Cock, and widow of Joseph Coles o
2 CONC f Musketa Cove.
