1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mary Prior
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary was born at a place to check. She was the daughter of Samuel & Mary Prior. Mary married John Searing IV, son of John Searing III and Elizabeth (?), on 5 January 1764 at the Quaker Meeting House, Westbury, Hempstead Town, Quee
2 CONC ns County, Long Island, New York.1 John & Mary had children: Mary [12/12/1764], John [2/11/1766], Amey [2/23/1768] & Phebe. Mary departed this life at Hempstead Town, Nassau County, Long Island, New York.
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT
2 CONT [S79] William Wade Hinshaw, Encyclopedia of American Quaker Genealogy, [FR:Oakwood Cemetery:FR].
