1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 405. Thomas Thorn was born on 11 Sep 1719 in Flushing, Long Island, NY. He died on 12 Sep 1781 in North Castle, Westchester Co, NY. He died at age 62 He was buried about 14 Sep 1781 in Prob a Westchester Co. Quaker
2 CONC  burial ground. He is probably buried at North castle MM Quaker burial ground, but many of his descendents are buried at Chappaqua MM burial ground, they set aside a special place for our family. Chappaqua was originally part of N
2 CONC orthcastle MM. He had an estate probated on 12 Feb 1785. He was Quaker. His will gave evidence of considerable estate. was elected road overseer twice in Northcastle, NY 
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Thorn is the step father to his son Thomas' wife Hannah Sutton. He married as his second wife Elizabeth Brown widow of James Sutton. Sarah Haight was the mother of ALL the children except for last child Sherwood Thorne. Thi
2 CONC s, per Mildred E. Struble of the Hugenot Historical Society, was Thorne family knowledge, which thus far, I've found reliable. Thomas was a member of the Purchase Friends Monthly Meeting. When Thomas was married to first Sarah it 
2 CONC was recorded in the Purchase Friends records. So at that point He was a Friend in good standing. Later none of his children by either marriage were birthright Friends. Thomas was a Friend in good standing of the Purchase Monthly M
2 CONC eeting, but for some reason, some of his off spring had to apply to join the Friends, indicating they were not birthright Friends. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: Beginning with his Father, Samuel they began dropping the "E" off Thorne.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was married to Sarah Haight (daughter of John Haight and Phebe Titus) about 1739 in New York. Sarah Haight was born on 6 Mar 1725/26 in Newtown, Nassau, NY. She died after 1762 in North Castle, Westchester Co, NY. She was burie
2 CONC d in Friends Cemetery, Westchester CO, New York. Buried probably Armonk-Northcastle-Chappaqua Friends Cemeteries. Sarah is the Mother of all of Thomas' Children EXCEPT the last child, a son named Sherwood. His Mother is the second
2 CONC  wife Elizabeth Brown. Thomas Thorn and Sarah Haight had the following children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT +674 i. Stevenson Thorn. 
2 CONT
2 CONT +675 ii. Samuel Thorne. 
2 CONT
2 CONT +676 iii. Elnathan Thorn. 
2 CONT
2 CONT +677 iv. Hannah Thorne. 
2 CONT
2 CONT +678 v. Thomas Thorne. 
2 CONT
2 CONT +679 vi. James Thorne. 
2 CONT
2 CONT +680 vii. Isaac Thorne. 
2 CONT
2 CONT +681 viii. John Thorn. 
2 CONT
2 CONT +682 ix. Sarah Thorne. 
2 CONT
2 CONT +683 x. Anna Thorne.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was married to Elizabeth Brown (daughter of Samuel Brown and Hannah Rundle) before 1767. Elizabeth Brown was born on 27 Nov 1724 in New York. She died in New York. Elizabeth Brown was wife no. 2. She was mother to Thomas'last c
2 CONC hild, son Sherwood. She is believed to be widow of James Sutton and dtr of Hannah Brown. She was the Widow of James Sutton. Thomas Thorn and Elizabeth Brown had the following children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT +684 i. Sherwood Thorn.
