2 CONT Paternal relationship is confirmed by a triangulated group consisting of Duane Kelly, BG, CG, and LS, who share a 10.5 cM segment on chromosome 2. The most-recent common ancestors shared by all four are George Soule Sr and his wif
2 CONC e Mary (Bucket) Soule.
