2 CONT
2 CONT VIII.       BENJAMIN DOSENBORO, born circa 1710, and died in 1791, near Jamaica on Long Island.He was a Quaker and accused of becoming a Quaker by the Hempstead town council solely to avoid service in the local militia during the 
2 CONC French and Indian War.BENJAMIN married on 30 August 1728, SARAH SEAMAN.
