1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Esther first married Timothy Smith, March 13, 1803. They had two known children, Hugh Shotwell Smith and Rosetta Smith.
2 CONT
2 CONT Following Timothy's death in 1816, she married George Clark Seaton. Esther and George had two children, Charlotte Ann and Jonathan David.
2 CONT =====================================
2 CONT Thursday, June 23, 1870, Rockford Weekly Gazette (Rockford, IL), pg. 3
2 CONT
2 CONT In this city, at the residence of her son-in-law, E.R. Riggs, on the 10th, Esther Seaton, aged 81 years, 9 months, and 11 days, died.
2 CONT
2 CONT Inscription;
2 CONT 84 yrs 9 mos 11 days; Mother-in-law of E.R. Riggs
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
