1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "207. ELIZABETH H.7 LUNDY (SAMUEL7, SAMUEL6, RICHARD5, RICHARD4, RICHARD3, SYLVESTER2, RICHARD1 LYNDYE) was born 1800, and died 1857. She married ZACHARIAH SHOTWELL, son of BENJAMIN SHOTWELL and BATHSHEBA POUND. He
2 CONC  was born August 08, 1788 in Warren Co. , New Jersey, and died September 18, 1857 in Macedon, Wayne Co. , New Jersey.
2 CONT
