2 CONT
2 CONT Father of (by 2nd wife Edna): Daniel Lundy (Mary P. Iden) & Edwin (Sarah Harkness) Shotwell.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of (by third wife Elizabeth H.): Samuel (Sarah Smith Underhill) & Edna Ann (Jesse McKeel) Shotwell. (1850 Macedon census)
2 CONT
