2 CONT 6. Elizabeth Smith (alive and single in 1698)
2 CONT
2 CONT ———-
2 CONT
2 CONT John Smith married secondly, 1672,  Elizabeth Wickes, daughter of John and Mary Wickes of Warwick, Rhode Island, and widow of Richard Townsend. John's will made 2 July 1694, proved 6 Sep 1694, called himself the "son-in-law" of Ri
2 CONC chard Gildersleeve and used the same term to identify Richard Townsend, Jr, the son of his second wife. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth m. 2d, John Smith “nan” of Hempstead, widower of Anne Gildersleeve, and had by him dau. Elizabeth Smith.
