2 CONT Brief Life History of Daniel
2 CONT
2 CONT When Daniel Sweet was born in 1658, in Warwick, Rhode Island, British Colonial America, his father, John Sweet Jr., was 38 and his mother, Elizabeth Temperance Jeffrey, was 29. He married Ethalenah Carpenter about 1683, in East Gr
2 CONC eenwich, Kent, Rhode Island, United States. They were the parents of at least 6 sons and 3 daughters. He died on 23 December 1732, in Gloucester, Providence, Rhode Island, British Colonial America, at the age of 74.
