2 CONC o 1, Warwick, 1703-1745, page 129-133. Lehi, UT, USA: Ancestry.com Operations, Inc., 2015.
2 CONT ↑ Probate Records, Glocester, Rhode Island, Ancestry.com (https://www.ancestry.com/imageviewer/collections/9079/images/007649095_00011?pId=668216 : accessed 23 oct 2020), record is not indexed, Ancestry Operations, Inc.
