2 CONT Brief Life History of Timothy Carpenter
2 CONT
2 CONT When Timothy Carpenter Williams was born in 1721, in Johnston, Providence, Rhode Island, British Colonial America, his father, Peleg Williams, was 43 and his mother, Elizabeth Carpenter, was 36. He married Hannah Smith about 1740,
2 CONC  in Springfield, Windsor, Vermont, United States. They were the parents of at least 2 sons and 5 daughters. He died in 1796, in Springfield, Windsor, Vermont, United States, at the age of 75.
