2 CONT Husband of Hannah (Carpenter) Arnold — married 9 Dec 1709 (to 1744) in Warwick, Kent, Rhode Islandmap
2 CONT Husband of Patience Aldridge (Hyde) Arnold — married 23 Dec 1744 in Warwick, Kent, Rhode Islandmap
2 CONT DESCENDANTS descendants
2 CONT Father of William Benedict Arnold, Mary (Arnold) Matteson, Elisha Arnold Jr., Joseph Arnold, Nathaniel Arnold, James Arnold, Israel Arnold, Thomas Arnold, Hannah (Arnold) Crossman and John Arnold
2 CONT Died 23 Dec 1748 in Rhode Islandmap
2 CONT Profile manager: Chris Hoyt private message [send private message]
2 CONT Arnold-309 created 30 Dec 2010 | Last modified 28 Aug 2020
2 CONT This page has been accessed 1,678 times.
2 CONT [Note: Arnold Memorial lists Hannah Carpenter Arnold's death as March 24, 1711. And attributes children after William, to Patience. However, Warwick Births show children of Elisha and Hannah born through 1731and marriage to Patien
2 CONC ce Hide in 1744. ThArnold Memorial text is obviously in error. ]
2 CONT
