2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Elisha Arnold, son of Israel and Mary (Barker/Smith) Arnold was born about 1683, likely at Pawtuxet (village of Warwick) Rhode Island. [1] [2] [3]
2 CONT
2 CONT He married first Hannah Carpenter, daughter of Timothy and Hannah (Wickes) Carpenter on December 9, 1709. [4] [2] [5]
2 CONT
2 CONT He married on December 23, 1744, second Patience, daughter of Joseph and Mercy (Aldrich) Hyde. [5] [4] [2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Elisha died on December 23, 1748. [2]
2 CONT
2 CONT His will dated November 8, 1748, was proved on February 13, 1749, Patience being executrix. In it he names:
2 CONT
2 CONT sons William, Elisha Jr., Nathaniel, Joseph, Israel, Thomas, James
2 CONT daughters Mary Matteson, and Hannah. [2] [6]
2 CONT He was buried in cemetery east of Centerville off the road between Apponaug and Centerville. [2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children by Hannah
2 CONT
2 CONT William born on November 4, 1710. [5] [3]
2 CONT Mary born on November 6, 1712. [5] [3]
2 CONT Elisha born on November 25, 1713. [5] [3]
2 CONT Joseph born on March 2, 1716. [5] [3]
2 CONT Nathaniel born on September 15, 1717. [5] [3]
2 CONT James born on September 30. 1719. [5] [3]
2 CONT Israel born on May 15, 1721. [5] [3]
2 CONT Thomas born on May 25, 1724. [5] [3]
2 CONT Hannah born on March 24, 1727. [5] [3]
2 CONT John born on April 27, 1731. [5] [3]
