2 CONT Brief Life History of Freelove
2 CONT
2 CONT When Freelove Gorton was born on 27 April 1718, in Swansea, Bristol, Massachusetts, United States, her father, Samuel Gorton, was 27 and her mother, Freelove Mason, was 22. She married Daniel Vaughan on 30 June 1744, in Trinity Ch
2 CONC urch, Newport, Newport, Rhode Island, United States. They were the parents of at least 2 sons and 1 daughter. She lived in Rhode Island, United States in 1718.
