1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Arthur H Engle was the son of Obadiah Engle and Patience Coles, grandson of Joseph Engle and Mary Borton and great grandson of Robert Engle and Rachel Vinicum.
2 CONT
2 CONT Arthur married Elizabeth B Engle, December 12th, 1820. Elizabeth was born April 25, 1802 and was the daughter of Robert Engle and Mary Woolman, granddaughter of Robert Engle and Jane Sharp and great granddaughter of Robert Engle a
2 CONC nd Rachel Vinicum.
2 CONT
2 CONT Arthur and Elizabeth shared great grandparents.
2 CONT
2 CONT Arthur and Elizabeth had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Ezra 1821-1900 married Sarah A Prickett Emeline B 1823-1899 married Josiah J Prickett Ann C 1826-1896 married Thomas S. Prickett Mary W 1832-1904 married Joseph H Roberts Robert Barclay 1834-1901 married Jane E. Darnell
2 CONT
2 CONT Arthur's wife Elizabeth died Oct 23, 1863. Arthur married second Edith Buzby in 1866 and she died April 1, 1871, he married third Edith Haines.
