1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/14982127/joseph-bishop-vansciver '''Joseph Bishop VanSciver - Find A Grave'''] - MEMORIAL ID 14982127
2 CONT
2 CONT Businessman. He grew up in Camden, New Jersey, and attended the city's public schools. In 1881, he started a furniture company at the corner of Delaware Avenue and Federal Street. The company grew to ship both nationally and inter
2 CONC nationally. On June 9, 1892 he married '''Florence Groff Kelly''' at the First Baptist Church in Camden. The couple had '''four children''', and lived in Chestnut Hill.
2 CONT
2 CONT Listed Children: Joseph Bishop Van Sciver 1893–1981, Lloyd Van Sciver 1896–1954
2 CONT -------
