1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Reference: [https://www.myheritage.com/research/record-40001-219332096/thomas-faulconer-in-familysearch-family-tree FamilySearch Family Tree] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Feb 5 2
