1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Joyce Faulconer Renox BIRTH	1798 Fayette County, Kentucky, USA DEATH	1863 (aged 64–65) Marion County, Missouri, USA BURIAL	 Greenwood Cemetery Palmyra, Marion County, Missouri
