2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/92236443/joyce-renox
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Dr. Ambrose NELSON Nov 21, 1812 in Fayette Co, KY. Children with him: Sarah F., Lewis, Martha Ann, Mary Daniel, Napoleon Bonapart.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Isaac Pitman CLOUDAS May 18, 1826 in Mercer Co, KY. Children with him: Margaret, Frances, and Milton Pitman.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Cyrus RENOX (Rennick, Rennic, Renick) July 1, 1839 in Lewis Co, MO.  Child with him, Elizbeth Jane.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children Photo	 Napoleon Bonapart Nelson 1817–1868
2 CONT
