2 CONT In Fielden Fleming plot #1 Palmyra Cemetery
2 CONT
2 CONT Obituary from Palmyra Spectator, july 31, 1868 Died, on Monday last at the residence of her son-in-law, Mr. Fielden Fleming, of this place, Mrs. JOYCE RENNICKS, of cancer, after a painful illness of about two years. The deceased w
2 CONC as in the 66th year of her age, and was a daughter of Mr. Joseph Falkner, of Fayete county, Ky. She was a most estimable lady, for many years a worthy member of Gideon Baptist Church, and died in full hope of a blissful immortalit
