1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Note about children===
2 CONT
2 CONT DNA ties https://www.geni.com/people/Mary-Polly-Richards-Lance-McCormick/6000000018872666067 to the Haines family, and Moses's father James married a Haines widow.  Her son Joshua Haines, born after the death of his father, died a
2 CONC t age 19.  I hypothesize that his natural daughter was adopted by Moses or another step-sibling and given his name.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Life===
2 CONT
2 CONT Moses inherited from his father James the lands given to James for his services in the Indian Wars. (James divided the lands on the Ohio among his children and most of them moved to Cabell Co. before 1820.) Moses evidently lost hi
2 CONC s family in Cabell Co., or they moved away, as they are not mentioned in his will.
2 CONT
