1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Birth:  Sep. 2, 1677 Wilmslow Cheshire East Unitary Authority Cheshire, England  Death:  Mar. 17, 1756 Plumsteadville Bucks County Pennsylvania, USA 
2 CONT
2 CONT PLEASE NOTE THAT THE DATE OF DEATH IS THE DATE HIS WILL WAS TAKEN THROUGH PROBATE. THEREFORE, LAWRENCE DIED AFTER 27 JUL 1752 (DATE OF WILL) AND BEFORE 17 MAR 1756 (DATE WILL PROVEN).
2 CONT
2 CONT ******************
2 CONT
2 CONT LAWRENCE PEARSON WAS THE SON OF EDWARD AND SARAH BURGESS PEARSON (PIERSON) AND WAS BORN IN POWNALL FEE TOWNSHIP, WILMSLOW PARISH, CHESHIRE, ENGLAND.
2 CONT
2 CONT HE IMMIGRATED TO AMERICA ABOUT 1687, ARRIVING IN PENNSYLVANIA.
2 CONT
2 CONT HE MARRIED ANNE COOPER ABOUT JUL 1704 IN BUCKS COUNTY, PENNSYLVANIA. GOD BLESSED THIS MARRIAGE WITH THE FOLLOWING CHILDREN: JOSEPH, MARY HANNAH, PRISCILLA, ENOCH WILLIAM, MARTHA AND ELIZABETH PEARSON.
2 CONT
2 CONT LAWRENCE PEARSON WAS THE SIBLING OF MARY MARTHA, DEBORAH, SARAH, ENOCH, PHOEBE AND MARTHA PEARSON.
2 CONT
2 CONT LAWRENCE PEARSON WAS MY 7TH GREAT-GRANDFATHER.
2 CONT
2 CONT *****************
2 CONT
2 CONT AFTER LANDING IN PENNSYLVANIA ON THE THE 29TH DAY OF THE 7TH MONTH 1687 (29 SEP 1687), EDWARD AND HIS FAMILY SETTLED NEAR DARBY, PENNSYLVANIA.
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCE:
2 CONT
2 CONT BOOK: "THE PEARSON FAMILY TREE FROM ENGLAND TO AMERICA" (PAGE 37) BY ENID PEARSON HAWTHORNE
2 CONT
2 CONT *****************
2 CONT
2 CONT England & Wales, Quaker Birth, Marriage, and Death Registers, 1578-1837 Name: Lawrence Peirson Event Type: Birth Birth Date: 2 Sep 1677 Birth Place: Pownall Fee, Chester, England Gender: Male Father: Edward Peirson Mother: Sarah P
2 CONC eirson Meeting: Monthly Meeting of Cheshire, formerly Morley Piece Description: Piece 1398: Monthly Meeting of Cheshire, formerly Morley (1654-1776)
2 CONT
2 CONT Source Citation: The National Archives; Kew, England; General Register Office: Society of Friends' Registers, Notes and Certificates of Births, Marriages and Burials; Class: RG 6; Piece: 1398.
2 CONT
2 CONT *****************
2 CONT
2 CONT  U. S. AND INTERNATIONAL MARRIAGE RECORD 1560-1900
2 CONT
2 CONT NAME: ADM LAWRENCE PIERSON GENDER: MALE BIRTH PLACE: EN [ENGLAND] BIRTH YEAR: 1677 SPOUSE NAME: ANN COOPER MARRIAGE: 1705 MARRIAGE STATE: PA [PENNSYLVANIA] NUMBER PAGE: 1
2 CONT
