2 CONT WILL ABSTRACT - LAWRENCE PEARSON
2 CONT
2 CONT DATED 27 JUL 1752
2 CONT
2 CONT PROVEN 17 MAR 1756
2 CONT
2 CONT PEARSON, Lawrence of Plumstead, Yeoman. July 27, 1752. Proved March 17, 1756.
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife Ann. Samuel Armitage and son-in-law Samuel McKinstry, exrs.
2 CONT
2 CONT Son Joseph. Daus. Hannah Fenton, Martha Shrigley, Mary Jewell and Priscilla McKinstry.
2 CONT
2 CONT Grandchildren, Lawrence Pearson, Lawrence Shrigley, Arthur and Enock Allen and Mary Allen. John Craft.
2 CONT
2 CONT All lands to be sold.
2 CONT
2 CONT Wit: Jos. Doan, Israel Doan, Esther Doan.
2 CONT
2 CONT REFERENCE:
2 CONT
2 CONT Abstracts of Bucks County, Pennsylvania, Wills, 1685-1785 Book 2, Page 289. 
2 CONT
