1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Enoch born March 27, 1683 in Pownall Fee, Chester, Cheshire Co., England Son of Edward Pearson and Sarah (Burgess) Pearson http://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Pearson-357
2 CONT
2 CONT (Not to be confused with [http://www.geni.com/people/Enoch-Pearson-son-of-Thomas-wife-Mary/6000000033697292645 Enoch] born in Chester, PA, 1690 son of Thomas Pearson married Mary Smith.)
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Quaker Elder===
2 CONT Attending, with other from Bucks County, the Phila. Yearly Mtg.<br/>
2 CONT September 29, 1735<br/>
2 CONT ''complete Bucks County delegation:'' Edward Lucas, Adam Harker,  John Stackhouse, Esther Stapler, Agnes Penquite, John Laycock, Thomas Canby, Enoch Pearson, John Dyer, William Michener
