2 CONT Stephanus Haworth [Parents] 1 was born 17 Feb 1713 in Buckingham Twp, Bucks, PA. He died 19 Mar 1765 in , Rowan, NC. Stephanus married Rachel Beeson on 1740 in , Frederick, VA.
2 CONT
2 CONT DEATH: Rowan County now Guilford County. Some researchers have death date as 1 Sept 1756.  Since his youngest children were probably born in 1757, the 19 March 1765 death date seems more probable.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage: Hopewell Monthly Meeting, Frederick, VA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Rachel Beeson [Parents] was born 1724 in , , PA. She died 19 Mar 1775 in Cane Creek, Alamance, NC and was buried in , Guilford, NC. Rachel married Stephanus Haworth on 1740 in , Frederick, VA.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT  		M	i	 Stephanus Haworth 1 was born 1741 in , Frederick, VA. He died 18 Apr 1804 in , Guilford, NC.[Notes]
2 CONT
2 CONT  		M	ii	 Micajah Haworth 1 was born 18 Nov 1743 in , Frederick, VA. He died 29 Jun 1822 in , Davidson, NC and was buried in High Point, Guilford, NC.[Notes]
2 CONT
2 CONT  		F	iii	 Phebe Haworth 1 was born 1745 in , Frederick, VA. She died in , Guilford, NC.[Notes]
2 CONT
2 CONT  		F	iv	 Charity Haworth 1 was born 06 Jan 1749 in , Frederick, VA.[Notes]
2 CONT
2 CONT  		F	v	 Sarah M Haworth 1 was born 1750 in , Frederick, VA. She died 26 Mar 1789 in , Alamance, NC and was buried in , , NC.[Notes]
2 CONT
2 CONT  		F	vi	 Welmet Haworth 1 was born 1753 in , Frederick, VA.[Notes]
2 CONT
2 CONT  		M	vii	 George Haworth 1 was born 1757 in , Frederick, VA. He died 12 Mar 1842 and was buried in , , NC.[Notes]
2 CONT
2 CONT  		F	viii	 Rachel Haworth was born 09 Mar 1757 and died 1842.
