1 NAME John /Fisher/
2 GIVN John
2 SURN Fisher
2 _MARNM Fisher
2 NICK Wickliffe
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC Buckingham Friends Burial Groung, Buckingham, Bucks, Pennsylvania
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE 20 DEC 1672
2 ADDR
3 STAE England
1 DEAT
2 DATE 12 FEB 1765
