2 CONT <b>Scarbeary Family Website</b> : http://www.scarbeary.com/family_tree
2 CONT "5. ROBERT SCARBOROUGH, son of John Scarborough and Mary ?Pierson, was born 10 June 1708, Solebury Township, Bucks County, PA, died 19 January 1805, Union County, VA; buried in what is now WV. He married 1] c 1733 Bucks County, PA
2 CONC , ELIZABETH FISHER (most records show Elizabeth Haworth) daughter of John fisher and Sarah Hutchinson. Elizabeth died c1747. Robert married 2] c1750 Mary BAILEY, daughter of William Bailey.       Robert was a farmer and in 1737 so
2 CONC ld 157 acres of the farm in Solebury Township, Bucks County, PA, which he had inherited from his father, and moved to 5 miles southwest of present New Market, Orange (now Shenandoah) County, VA. He had 400 acres on both sides of S
2 CONC mith’s Creek, joining Absalom Haworth’s land. In 1737 he moved to Winchester, VA, and in 1747/50 (sic) moved to Bedford County, VA. Robert and several of his younger children moved to Greenbrier County, VA and he is believed to ha
2 CONC ve died there in 1805. He was a Quaker with membership at Hopewell MM, Frederick County, VA.  Robert and Elizabeth had issue:  i. JOHN SCARBOROUGH, b 11-28-1734, d 1813, m1] 5 May 1960 MARGARET KIRK, m2] JOHANNA (----) CAHOON. Joh
2 CONC n was a veteran of the Revolutionary War (SQF, vol 1, p24)  ii. ELIZABETH SCARBOROUGH, b 18 Sep 1736 Solebury Township, Buck County, PA. Robert and Mary Bailey had issue: 
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. WILLIAM SCARBOROUGH, 1753-1830, m EMILY WOOD 
2 CONT
2 CONT iv. JAMES SCARBOROUGH, 1755-1809, m RACHEL WOOD 
2 CONT
2 CONT v. SARAH SCARBOROUGH, m JAMES CHRISTY  vi. DAVID SCARBOROUGH, 1760- , m 3 May 1786 Greenbrier, VA (now WV), ELIZABETH ANDERSON  vii. ISAAC SCARBOROUGH, b bef 1762 in VA, m MARY WARD, dau of John Ward  viii. RACHEL (probably KEZIAH
2 CONC ) SCARBOROUGH b bef 1762, m 9 Sep 1791, JAMES KENNEDY  ix. SUSANNAH SCARBOROUGH, b aft 1765, VA, m 22 Mar 1787, Bedford County, VA, JOHN SMITH  x. ELIZABETH SCARBOROUGH, b in VA, m 22 Oct, Bedford County, VA, JAMES JOHNSON  xi. (6
2 CONC ) ROBERT SCARBOROUGH, b c1766 Bedford Co, VA, d c1840 MO; m1] 28 Nov 1785, Bedford Co, VA, MARY McGUIRE, m2] 29 Aug 1793 Franklin Co, VA, CATHERINE BEHELER"
2 CONT
