1 NAME Solomon H /Wright/ Sr.
2 GIVN Solomon H
2 SURN Wright
2 NSFX Sr.
2 _MARNM Wright
2 NICK Solomon H. Wright
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 27 JUL 1764
2 PLAC Bucks County, Pennsylvania, USA
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 12 SEP 1862
2 ADDR
3 STAE Pennsylvania
3 CTRY United States
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Son of Isaac and Sidney Rogers Wright
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Rachel Elmira Pickering on June 13 1787 in Bucks County,Pennsylvania.
2 CONT
2 CONT Research Notes:
2 CONT In 1773-Solomon bound out to Abel Walker
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1784-Solomon is granted permission by the church Fathers to transfer to Bucks County,Pennsylvania.His mother Sideny had moved there after her marriage to Isaac Pickering
2 CONT
2 CONT On 13 June 1787 Solomon marries Rachel Pickinger b:1752 d/o Isaac and Grace Lupton Pickering--his Step Sister
2 CONT
2 CONT Solomon is listed on the 1790,1800-1860 Census of North Carolina.The 1860 census lists his age as 92,born in Pennsylvania.His residence was listed in Yancy,Burke and Mitchell Counties(they were all form from the original)
2 CONT
2 CONT Solomon's first wife Rachel Pickering,was not shown on the 1830 census.In 1850 he had a wife named Myra
2 CONT The 1820 census lists Jonathon Wesley living "next door" to his father.
2 CONT The Solomon Wright homestead (called Sol Wright Hollow even now)was located on the Toe River near the present town of Bakersville,Mitchell County,North Carolina
2 CONT
2 CONT Solomon married Rachel Elmira Pickering,daughter of Isacc Pickering and Grace Lupton,on 13 Jun 1787 in Bucks County, Pennsylvania.Rachel was born on 17 Feb 1752 in Solesbury, Bucks County,Pennsylvania and died in Aug 1827 in Bucks
2 CONC  County,Pennsylvania at age 75.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
