2 CONT Born: Hannah Ellis, the daugher of Enos Ellis and Elizabeth Coulston, was born on November 13, 1750.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage: Hannah Ellis married Jacob Pickering, the son of Samuel Pickering, Jr. and Grace Stackhouse, on December 21, 1774 at the Middletown MM.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 1816, Frederick, Virginia, USA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Research Note
2 CONT Jacob and Hannah were witnesses at a marriage within Hopewell VA MM in December 1780. Marriage was Thomas Embree of Shenandoah County and Esther Coulson, Frederick County. Hannah was a Coulson/Coulston descendant.
