1 NOTE {geni:about_me} When Jane Ellis was born on 21 November 1755, in Exeter Township, Berks, Pennsylvania, United States, her father, Enos Ellis, was 30 and her mother, Elizabeth Coulston, was 28. She married John Pickering in 1775, i
2 CONC n Hartland, Clay, Virginia, United States. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 3 daughters. She died in 1805, in New Hope, Greene, Tennessee, United States, at the age of 50.
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Ellis of Exeter, Berks, Pennsylvania - Womens Monthly Meeting - 1763 Request for Removal to Hopewell MM for family
