2 CONT
2 CONT Jane Pickering formerly Ellis
2 CONT Born 21 Nov 1755 in Berks, Pennsylvaniamap
2 CONT ANCESTORS ancestors
2 CONT Daughter of Enos Ellis and Elizabeth (Coulston) Ellis
2 CONT Sister of Thomas Ellis, Hannah (Ellis) Pickering, Rebekah (Ellis) Pickering, Dinah Ellis, Ellis Ellis, William Ellis, Enos Ellis Jr., Jonathon Ellis and Elizabeth Ellis
2 CONT Wife of John Pickering — married 18 Oct 1775 in Middle Creek, Frederick Co, VAmap
2 CONT DESCENDANTS descendants
2 CONT Mother of John Pickering, William Pickering, Rachel Pickering, Rebekah Pickering, Mary (Pickering) Fawcett and Jane Pickering
2 CONT Died about 3 Feb 1843 at about age 87 in Greene, Tennessee, United Statesmap [uncertain]
