2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage: On October 18, 1775, John Pickering, the son of William and Sarah Pickering, of Frederick County, Virginia, married Jane Ellis, the daughter of Enos and Elizabeth Ellis, of the County of Berkerly, Colony of Virginia. The
2 CONC  marriage took place at Middle Creek, Frederick County, Virginia.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children: In order found in John Pickering's Will:[3]
