2 CONT William Pickering.
2 CONT Enos Pickering.
2 CONT Jonathan Pickering.
2 CONT Joshua Pickering.
2 CONT "Infant Brother."
2 CONT Sarah Pickering.
2 CONT Elizabeth Pickering.
2 CONT Rachel Pickering.
2 CONT Rebecca Pickering.
2 CONT Mary Pickering.
2 CONT Jane Pickering.
