1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT Ellis Ellis b 1760, Exeter MM, Berks Co. Penn, son of Enos and Elizabeth Coleston Ellis. Married Mary Pickering 18 Dec. 1782 at Back Creek, Berkeley or Frederick Cos. Va., dau of William Pickering and Sarah Wright Pickering. In 17
2 CONC 90 Ellis moved from Va. to Tenn. In 1795 Ellis Ellis was chosen overseer of New Hope MM Greene Co. NC, now Tenn.
2 CONT Their children: William 1783, Enos 1786-1841, Sarah Sally 1788-1840, John 1791, Jesse 1793, Jacob 1796-1858, Thomas 1800. Ellis Ellis died 13 Jan. 1808 New Hope MM, Greene Co. Tenn. He was buried in New Hope MM Cemetery, later nam
2 CONC ed Quaker Knob Cemetery.
2 CONT No grave marker found in Nov. 2013.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/88420400/ellis-ellis
