2 CONT Elizabeth Twining [1]
2 CONT *F, 
2 CONT *d. 10 March 1724/25
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Twining was the daughter of William Twining and Elizabeth Dean. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Twining married John Rogers, son of Joseph Rogers and Hannah, on 19 August 1669 at Eastham. Her married name was Rogers. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Twining died on 10 March 1724/25 at Eastham.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Elizabeth Twining and John Rogers
2 CONT *1. Samuel Rogers b. 1 Nov 1671, d. 3 Dec 1671
2 CONT *2. John Rogers+ b. 4 Nov 1672, d. 10 Jan 1738/39
2 CONT *3. Judah Rogers+ b. 23 Nov 1677
2 CONT *4. Joseph Rogers+ b. 22 Feb 1679, d. b 4 Aug 1757
2 CONT *5. Elizabeth Rogers b. 23 Oct 1682
2 CONT *6. Eleazer Rogers+ b. 19 May 1685, d. bt 20 Apr 1759 - 6 May 1760
2 CONT *7. Mehitable Rogers+ b. 13 Mar 1686/87, d. a 16 Sep 1760
2 CONT *8. Hannah Rogers+ b. 5 Aug 1689, d. a 22 Oct 1754
2 CONT *9. Nathaniel Rogers+ b. 3 Oct 1693
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT *1. [S1] Ann T. [Revised by], (Originally compiled by Alice W. A. Westgate) Reeves, Mayflower Families Through Five Generations: Descendants of the Pilgrims who landed at Plymouth, Mass. December 1620: Family of Thomas Rogers (Ply
2 CONC mouth, MA: General Society of Mayflower Descendants, 2000), p. 11. Hereinafter cited as Rogers-Silver.
2 CONT
