2 CONC T: Holbrook Research Institute (Jay and Delene Holbrook). William & Ruth Twining Family Twining, Thomas. Genealogy of the Twining Family (Chicago, 1890) Page 33 Leon Clark Hills, Cape Cod Series Vol. I: History and Genealogy of th
2 CONC e Mayflower Planters and First Comers to Ye Olde Colonie (Copyright 1936, Hills Publishing Company, Washington D.C.) Arthur D. Dean, Genealogy of the Dean Family: Descended from Ezra Dean, of Plainfield, Conn. and Cranston, R.I. (
2 CONC Printed 1903, F.H. Gerlock and Co., Scranton, PA) http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=oldmankew&id=I2840 • Note: unreferenced child: Susannah, b 25 Jan 1653/4, twin to William, d c 1657
