2 CONT Anna and Joanna Twining were sisters. Both were married to Thomas Bills. They are not the same person. Joanna Twining was born about 1657. She married Thomas Bills on 2 May 1676, following the 1675 death of her sister Anna, Thomas
2 CONC ' first wife.[1] She passed away on 4 Jun 1723.
