2 CONT Daughter of Henry and niece of John Howland of the "Mayflower.".
2 CONT
2 CONT ''''Abigail Howland 
2 CONT
2 CONT married John Young on Dec 16, 1648 in Plymouth Colony.
2 CONT
2 CONT John was born in England in 1624 
2 CONT
2 CONT (according to Pratt Records History of Aslen by sidney Perley).  
2 CONT
2 CONT He was recorded as resident in 1637.
2 CONT
2 CONT In a will dated 1688 he left all his real and personal property to his wife and kids  - 
2 CONT
2 CONT most the family probably died at the old Duxbury homestead.
2 CONT
