1 NAME John /Young/ I, of Eastham
2 GIVN John
2 SURN Young
2 NSFX I, of Eastham
2 _MARNM Young
2 NICK Gil
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE BET 1615 AND 1624
2 PLAC perhaps 
2 ADDR
3 CITY Elstow
3 CTRY England
1 BURI
2 DATE AFT 28 JAN 1691
