2 CONT **	iii. Hepsebah, b. April 16, 1649, m. Daniel Doane, of Eastham, and had a son, Constant Doane, b. Mar. 7, 1670. 
2 CONT **'''	iv. Ruth, b. April 15, 1651, m. John, oldest son''' of John and Abigail Young, of Eastham, '''(b. in Plymouth, Nov. 16, 1649). 
2 CONT **	8. v. Israel, b. Jan. 8, 1653. 
