2 CONT *http://books.google.com/books?id=kFoLBC2TwFYC&pg=PA1076&lpg=PA1076&dq=Joshua+Bangs+1646&source=bl&ots=7XtpZAHGxK&sig=k1v5w72U1OlLramFbP25HMTdE7M&hl=en&ei=jK4mTb-5GpGosAOUmdzBBw&sa=X&oi=book_result&ct=result&resnum=4&ved=0CCMQ6AEw
