1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Joseph Young (1654 - 1723)''', son of John Young and Abigail Howland, was born 19 December 1654 at Eastham, Barnstable County, Massachusetts. He died at the age of 69 in 1723 at Truro, Barnstable County. He marr
2 CONC ied '''Sarah (Davis) Young (1656 - 1721)''', daughter of Robert Davis (1615 - 1688) and Ann Davis (d. 1701), on 23 October 1679 at Yarmouth, Massachusetts.
2 CONT
