2 CONT -----------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Information taken from The Cabinet Card Gallery blog:
2 CONT
2 CONT  He served in the 13th Iowa Infantry (Company B). Sarah filed for Barclay’s civil war pension in 1898 stating that he had become an “invalid”. In 1923 she filed for his pension upon his death. She made the death claim while living
2 CONC  in Texas. Barclay George (1839-1923) is buried in the Fairview Cemetery in Pampa, Texas. 
