1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Jefferson Davis “J. D.” Burton, (1862-1943) prominent farmer of the Sulphur community, died at a Louisville hospital Tuesday.  He was one of the largest landowners in Henry County.  He was in the hospital but a few
2 CONC  days.
2 CONT
2 CONT Short funeral services were conducted at the grave in the Sulphur Cemetery at 2:30 p.m., Thursday, with his pastor, Rev. H. M. Wiley, officiating.
2 CONT
2 CONT Surviving Mr. Burton is one sister, Mrs. Annie B. Dean, and several nieces and nephews.
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry County Local  April 9, 1943
