1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Mary &quot;Polly&quot; Utterback (Parker)''' was born on November 2, 1797 in Virginia, USA. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34649863420 Martin Parker]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary married [https://www.geni.com/profile-56743223 William Utterback, Sr.] on July 22, 1820. Together they had the following 13 known children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-127810891 Mary Ann Utterback]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34816568859 William M Utterback, Jr]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-116453052 Martha Jacobs (Utterback)]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34816568862 John T Utterback, Died young]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-127816177 Elizabeth Lash (Utterback)]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34816568861 Nelson Utterback]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-33663701 Jordan Walker Utterback]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34816568860 Jackson Utterback]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-127816390 Sarah Jane Utterback, Died young]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34816568864 Bennett J. Utterback]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-127816436 Iverson Ellis Utterback]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34816568867 James Utterback]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34816568866 Julia Ann Magill (Utterback)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on May 16, 1877 near Franklin, Johnson County, Indiana, United States and was buried in Utterback Cemetery, Johnson County, Indiana, USA. 
2 CONT per Germanna Foundation:
2 CONT http://germannafamily.org/getperson.php?personID=I058531&tree=tree1
2 CONT * Reference: [http://germannafamily.org/getperson.php?personID=I058531&tree=tree1 TNG Genealogy] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Sep 26 2023, 15:24:35 UTC''
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary died May 16, 1877 in Johnson Co., Indiana.
2 CONT
2 CONT Cemetery:  Utterback Cemetery, about 1/2 mile west of SR135 on 200N.
2 CONT East of railroad.
2 CONT Cemetery is on south side of road about 1/2 mile off of 200N next to drive going to a house.
2 CONT Cemetery has a fence around it and is overgrown.
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/5017388/mary-utterback Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Sep 26 2023, 15:32:19 UTC''
