2 CONT Denny, Walter I-Margery  Denny, Walter I-Margery  Denny, Walter I-Margery  Denny, Walter I-Margery.  0  Footnote  Denny, Walter I-Margery  ShortFootnote  Denny, Walter I-Margery  Bibliography  Denny, Walter I-Margery. 
