2 CONT
2 CONT Find a Grave: 
2 CONT
2 CONT SHE HAS BEEN LISTED ON ROOTSWEB AND MANY OTHER SOURCES AS SARAH DENNY.THAT IS IN ERROR AS I FOUND OUT AND CORRECTED. THERE IS A (SARAH) MARGARET DENNY WHO MARRIED A JOHN EVANS SR WHOSE SON MARRIED (REBECCA) ANN MARTIN. THE CONFUSI
2 CONC ON STEMS FROM THE FACT THAT BOTH JOHN EVANS WERE IN THE REVOLUTIONARY WAR. ONE WAS A COL. THE JOHN EVANS IM DIRECTLY RELATED TO HIS RANK IS UNKNOWN AT THIS TIME.I HOPE THIS IS CLEARED UP ONCE AND FOR ALL AND THAT THE RECORDS FOUND
2 CONC  ON THE INTERNET WILL BE CORRECTED.HER PARENTS NAMES ARE UNKNOWN AT THIS TIME.THEY HAD 13 KNOWN CHILDREN.IN ADDITION TO DORCAS THEY HAD JOHN,SAMUEL,SARAH,MARY,JESSE,ELIZABETH,RACHEL,WILLIAM, ISAAC,ELLENDER,NANCY, AND EDWARD EVANS.
2 CONC IF ANYONE KNOWS WHO SARAHS PARENTS WERE PLEASE LET ME KNOW AND ILL ADD THE ADDITIONAL INFO.
2 CONT --------------------
