2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Husband of Miss Brittian and Jane. 1st Spouse: Hannah Brittian (1725-1769)
2 CONT
2 CONT "John Cantrell, Sr., was a miller and Baptist Minester. He helped establish the Buck Creek Baptist Chruch in Buck Creek, Sportanburg Co., South Carolina. He served as Pastor from 1800 to 1803. John is burried in Cantrell Family Ce
2 CONC metery. John had a brother by the name of Isaac Cantrell who was also a Baptist preacher at Buck Creek Baptist Church. The Cantrell Cemetery is near the the Buck Creek Baptist Chruch: Information from: Earnest H. Cantrell, Route 1
2 CONC , Box 50, Beaverton, Al. 35544, (1989)'".
2 CONT
2 CONT JOHN3 CANTRELL (JOSEPH2 CANTRILL, RICHARD1) was born October 1724 in New Castle, DE, and died 1803 in Spartanburg Co, SC.  He married (1) ?? BRITTAIN.  He married (2) JANE.
2 CONT
2 CONT John was in Rockingham Co NC before the Revolution.  He later moved to Spartanburg Co SC, where he owned over 800 acres on Buck Creek in the 96th District.  One of the first members of the Buck Creek Baptist Church, son Isaac was 
2 CONC a messenger there.  Sons Abraham, Stephen and Moses administered his estate.  His first 17 sons were by his first wife, four sons and two daughters by his second.  There were supposedly a number of twins in the family, and for the
2 CONC  sake of his first wife, let us fervently hope so. According to the Cantrell family file folder in the Georgia Archives, "Aaron, Simon and Peter were captured during the Revolution and were condemned to be shot.  Tradition says Pe
2 CONC ter was shot, and Aaron & Peter [sic] escaped."  The three were also supposedly scouts in Gen. Marion's army.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Children of John Cantrell and ?? Brittain are:
2 CONT      i.   ABRAHAM4 CANTRELL, b. ca 1744, New Castle. 4.   ii.  ISAAC CANTRELL, b. 1745, New Castle, DE; d. ca 1808, Spartanburg
2 CONT                                 Co, SC.
2 CONT      iii. JACOB CANTRELL, b. New Castle.
2 CONT      iv.  JOSEPH CANTRELL, b. New Castle.
2 CONT      v.   STEPHEN CANTRELL, b. ca 1749, New Castle.
2 CONT      vi.  JOHN CANTRELL, b. ca 1751, New Castle.
2 CONT      vii. CHARLES CANTRELL, m. SARAH MURRAY, 1772, Greensboro, NC.
2 CONT      viii.     JOSHUA CANTRELL.
2 CONT      ix.  AARON CANTRELL.
2 CONT      x.   SIMON CANTRELL.
2 CONT      xi.  PETER CANTRELL.
2 CONT      xii. THOMAS CANTRELL, b. 1761; d. 1830; m. ELIZABETH NORRIS.
2 CONT      xiii.     REUBEN CANTRELL.
2 CONT      xiv. EDWARD CANTRELL.
2 CONT      xv.  BENJAMIN CANTRELL.
2 CONT      xvi. BRITTAIN CANTRELL.
2 CONT      xvii.     JAMES CANTRELL.
