2 CONT
2 CONT Isaac Cantrell was the son of Joseph and Catharina Cantrell of Wilmington, New Castle Co., DE. He was the pastor of the Buck Creek Baptist Church from 1796-1799. He is probably buried in the Buck Creek Baptist Church Cemetery with
2 CONC  a field stone marker. He was the husband of 3 wives: Talitha, Elizabeth, and Mary and the father of 25 children.
