1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *1870 census: Epaphras Phelps (53, b NY) and wife Martha (54 (b Ct); in Indiana Township, Marion Co., Iowa w ch. William (19, b IA), Lucy (17, b IA), Spencer (15, b IA) and Burr? (11, b IA). Also there, and listed 
