1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Lucy Elizabeth Phelps was born in Iowa on Apr. 17, 1853; married on June 10, 1872 in Marion Co., Iowa with '''FREDERICK A. HARDING''', son of Emery A. Harding and Lucinda Rogers. In 1880, residing in Franklin, Mari
2 CONC on Co., Iowa. Children all born Iowa.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children were: Maude Camella (2/2/1875), Ella Emma (3/8/1877), Emery Allen (5/15/1878), Frederick Augustus (1/10/1879), Lola Phelps (1/5/1882), Seth (9/1/1882), and Martha Lucinda (8/11/1887).
2 CONT
2 CONT *1856 census: Lucy E. Phelps (3, b IA); in Guilford, Iowa w parents.
2 CONT *1872 marriage record: Lucy E. Phelps m. Frederick A. Harding on June 10, 1872 in Marion Co., Iowa.
2 CONT *1880 census (orig. not avail; dates are off): Lucy Harding (28, b Iowa) and husband Fred A. Harding (46; b Iowa); in Franklin, Marion Co., Iowa w ch. Emory (7, b IA), Maud (5 b IA), Ella (3b IA) and Fred (0, b IA). Husband is a m
2 CONC erchant. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lucy Elizabeth Harding'''  .....  Birth:  Apr. 17, 1853  Death:  Jun. 28, 1890 Marion County Iowa, USA 
2 CONT
2 CONT same stone as Augusta 
2 CONT *Inquiry made to memorial manager 5/9/2014 re her date of birth: One record says 1853; stone MAY say 1858.
