1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Loretta passed away peacefully on December 8, 2016 at age 100. She was born in Seattle on August 4, 1916, and was proud to have been a descendant of the Seattle pioneering Denny family. She was preceded in death by
2 CONC  her husband of 66 years, Leonard "Bud" Myhre who died in 2006, her daughter Sharon Mihelich who died in 2015, as well as a brother and a sister. She is survived by two sons, Larry (Joan) and Phil (Linda), her sister Shirley Thoma
2 CONC s (Bill), seven grandchildren, thirteen great-grandchildren and two great-great-grandchildren.
2 CONT
2 CONT A memorial service will be held at 2:00 PM on Friday, December 16 at Crista Senior Living's Chapel, 19301 Kings Garden Dr., Shoreline, WA.
