2 CONT Jemima Elizabeth Reed was the daughter of John Warren & Louiza Bethel. She was born in Washington Co., IN. Her first husband was Jasper Hitchcock by whom she had 3 children, Barnabus, Mary (Cool) and David. Her 2nd husband was Jon
