1 NOTE {geni:about_me} RHODA CADY (1739–1799) was born on May 5, 1739 in Killingly, Windham, Connecticut. She married James Chaffee in Killingly, Conn. on August 8, 1759, as his second wife. He had nine children with his first wife. Rhod
2 CONC a and James had eleven children. She died May 22, 1799 and was buried in the same grave with her husband in Moulton Hill Cemetery, Monson, Hampden County, Masssachusetts.
