2 CONC ealogy.com/chaffee/messages/439.html Data: Text: JAMES4 CHAFFEE (JOSEPH3, JOSEPH2, THOMAS1) was born in SWANSEA, MASS 1713. CONT He married twice. He married BERIAH HAYDEN in WOODSTOCK, CON, 6/16/1737. BERIAH was born in WOODSTOCK
2 CONC , CON 2/10/1715. BERIAH died 6/24/1758 at 43 years of age. He married RHODA CADY in KILLINGLY, CON, 8/8/1759. RHODA died 6/22/1799. CONT JAMES CHAFFEE and BERIAH HAYDEN had the following children: CONT 90 i. NATHAN5 CHAFFEE (2) wa
2 CONC s born in WOODSTOCK, CON. CONT 291 ii. ZEBEDIAH CHAFFEE was born 4/11/1741. CONT 92 iii. DOROTHY CHAFFEE was born in WOODSTOCK, CON 5/6/1743. DOROTHY died 10/27/1823 at 80 years of age. She was baptized in WOODSTOCK, CON, 5/22/174
2 CONC 3. Religion: religion unknown. CONT 293 iv. SARAH CHAFFEE was born 4/27/1746. CONT 294 v. JAMES CHAFFEE (JR) was born 3/22/1748. CONT 295 vi. NATHAN CHAFFEE was born 11/17/1750. CONT 96 vii. ABIGAIL CHAFFEE was born in WOODSTOCK, 
2 CONC CON 1/2/1753. He was baptized in WOODSTOCK, CON, 3/11/1753. Religion: religion unknown. CONT 297 viii. CHESTER CHAFFEE was born 4/6/1755. CONT 98 ix. CALVIN CHAFFEE was born in WOODSTOCK, CON 5/12/1757. He was baptized in WOODSTOC
2 CONC K, CON, 5/29/1757. Religion: religion unknown. CONT JAMES CHAFFEE and RHODA CADY had the following children: CONT 299 x. CALVIN CHAFFEE (2) was born 2/3/1760. CONT 300 xi. ABIAL CHAFFEE was born 8/13/1761. CONT 301 xii. CHARLES CH
2 CONC AFFEE was born 6/14/1763. CONT 02 xiii. LUCY CHAFFEE was born in WOODSTOCK, CON 8/18/1765. She was baptized in WOODSTOCK, CON, 10/25/1765. Religion: religion unknown. CONT 03 xiv. MARTHA CHAFFEE was born in WOODSTOCK, CON 6/22/176
2 CONC 8. MARTHA died 4/13/1772 at 3 years of age. She was baptized in WOODSTOCK, CON, 7/3/1768. Religion: religion unknown. CONT 304 xv. CHADWICK CHAFFEE was born 3/16/1771. CONT 305 xvi. STEPHEN CHAFFEE was born 9/25/1773. CONT 06 xvii
2 CONC . JEMIMA CHAFFEE was born in WOODSTOCK, CON 5/30/1778. CONT 307 xviii. JOSEPH CHAFFEE was born 6/30/1780. CONT 308 xix. LEONARD CHAFFEE was born 4/11/1782. CONT Hope this helps, best regards, Chloe
2 CONT Source: S494 Title: Chaffee/Chafee Lineage in America Abbreviation: Chaffee/Chafee Lineage in America Publication: http://www.geocities.com/heartland/cabin/1066/136Chafe_Home.html Note: CHAFFEE REFERENCES CONT CONT Bowen, Clarence
2 CONC  Winthrop, Ph.D., LLD., The History of Woodstock, Connecticut, Genealogies of Woodstock Families, Vol. 3 (Norwood, MA: Privately printed by The Plimpton Press, 1930). CONT CONT Chaffee, William H., The Chaffee Genealogy (embracing
2 CONC  the Chafe, Chafy, Chafie, Chafey, Chafee, Chaphe, Chaffy, Chaffie, Chaffey, Chaffe, Chaffee Descendants of Thomas Chaffe, of Hingham, Hull, Rehoboth and Swansea, Massachusetts also certain Lineages from Families in the United Sta
2 CONC tes, Canada and England, not descended from Thomas Chaffe), 1635-1909 (New York: The Grafton Press, 1909). Repository: NEHGS. CONT CONT Hills, William Sanford, comp., Thomas Hills, edit., The Hills Family in America: The Ancestry 
2 CONC and Descendants of William Hills, the English Emigrant to New England in 1632; of Joseph Hills, the English Emigrant to New England in 1638, and of the Great-grandsons of Robert Hills, of the Parish of Wye, County of Kent, England
2 CONC , Emigrants to New England 1794-1806 (reprint of 1906 ed.; Decorah, IA: The Anundsen Publishing Co., 1984). CONT CONT Lincoln, George, History of the Town of Hingham, Massachusetts: Vols. II, III, The Genealogies (Somersworth, NH:
2 CONC  New England History Press, 1982, originally published 1893). CONT CONT Rounds, H.L. Peter, comp., Vital Records of Swansea, Massachusetts to 1850 (Boston: NEHGS, 1992). CONT CONT Savage, James, A Genealogical Dictionary of The Fi
