2 CONT https://archive.org/details/chaffeegenealogy01chaf/page/126/mode/1up
2 CONT
2 CONT 295 Chadwick s Chaffee (James,* Joseph, 3 Joseph, 2 Thomas 1) was born in Woodstock, Conn., March 16, 1771, and died in Monson, Mass., September 6,
2 CONT 1848. He married there, Abigail, daughter of Freeborn Moulton of that place. She was born April 23, 1773, and died in Monson, March 17, 1838, where she was buried. Chadwick Chaffee was baptized in the First Congregational Church o
2 CONC f Woodstock, March 24, 1771. He had a light complexion and was five feet, eight inches in height. He lived in Monson, where he was a farmer. He died while out driving.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children, the first ten born in Monson:
2 CONT
2 CONT + 790 i Freeborn Moulton « Chaffee, born August 9, 1794; married Mrs. Betsey (Leonard) Squire.
2 CONT
2 CONT + 791 ii James Austin Chaffee, born December 7, 1796; married (1) Susan Thresher; (2) Martha Dunham.
2 CONT
2 CONT + 792 iii Ira Chaffee, born August 2, 1798; married (1) Anna Davis; (2) Anna Ladd Chaffee (3525) ; (3) Eunice Butler. 793 iv Lotheta Chaffee, born June 29, ISOO; died in Stafford, Conn., November 24, 1869; married, November 12, 18
2 CONC 43, Erasmus Rood of that place, their marriage intention being published in ]\Ionson, October 13, 1843; they lived in Stafford and had no children; she was buried in Staffordville, Conn.
2 CONT
2 CONT + 794 V Orinda Chaffee, born February 14, 1802; married Gad Davis.
2 CONT
2 CONT + 795 vi Stephen Chaffee, born January 26, 1804; married Betsey Davis.
2 CONT
2 CONT + 796 vii Annis M. Chaffee, born May 22, 1806; married Heustis.
2 CONT
2 CONT 797 viii Rhoda Cady Chaffee, born May 14, 1808; died June 25, 1844; married in South Wilbraham, Mass., May 27, 1832, Hiram Merrick of Ellington, Conn., and had two children; the family moved to Iowa and were all thought to be dead
2 CONC  in 1890.
2 CONT
2 CONT + 798 ix Calvin Chaffee, born June 12, 1810; married Betsey A. Morgan.
2 CONT
2 CONT + 799 X Julius Chaffee, born January 13, 1813; married Polly Ellis.
2 CONT
2 CONT + 800 xi Almond Chaffee, born ]\Iay 29, 1815; married Melissa R. F. Washburn.
2 CONT
2 CONT + 801 xii Abigail Rebecca Chaffee, born June 12, 1817; married EH M.Smith.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.monson-ma.gov/183/Burials-in-Moulton-Hill-Road-Cemetery
2 CONT
2 CONT Chaffee, Chadwick - age 77 years - son of James and Rhoda (Cady) Chaffee and husband of 1st wife Abigail (Moulton) Chaffee and 2nd wife Olive (Colburn) (Rogers) Chaffee - born in Woodstock Conn. on March 16, 1771 and died in Monso
2 CONC n on September 6, 1848
