1 NOTE Abishai S. Underwood was maned for Abishai Sabine, once clerk of probate at Woodstock, Conn.; he rem. to Cazenovia, N.Y., about 1800. His first wife and her child are buried at the village cemetery at New Woodstock in the south pa
2 CONC rt of that town. Near here (Georgetown, N.Y.) he was married to his second wife and eight of his children were born. He rem. to Clymer, Chautauqua county, N.Y.; in 1826 and to Greene, Ohio, in 1836 where his wife Mary died. He the
2 CONC n married a lady from Clymer, N.Y., and rem. to Waushara, Dodge county, Wis., where he died.
