1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mary Ann Barnes Hartman BIRTH	12 Jul 1833 Parke County, Indiana, USA DEATH	28 Mar 1905 (aged 71) Parke County, Indiana, USA BURIAL	 Hartman Family Cemetery Parke County, Indiana, USA Add to Map MEMORIAL ID	39436268
2 CONC  · View Source
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/39436268/mary-ann-hartman
2 CONT
2 CONT d/o James H. Barnes and Sarah
2 CONT
2 CONT Married John Kratzer Hartman, September 1, 1852 in Parke County, Indiana - source Marriage books, page 98
2 CONT
2 CONT Her sister, Harriette Barnes married Silas Adams, both buried in the Adams Cemetery
2 CONT
2 CONT NOTE: the creator, Zoe Tom indicates full name of father as James Hawkins Barnes b: Sep 17, 1797/1798 in KY (no sources); while other families name him James Henry Barnes with the same birth date; died July 18, 1873 in Parke Count
2 CONC y, Indiana
2 CONT
2 CONT NOTE: the creator, Zoe Tom indicates full name of mother as Sarah Barnes b: Jan 16, 1801 in KY (no sources); while other families show a birth date of January 16, 1805 in VA - census records indicate she was born about 1805, KY
2 CONT
2 CONT Ten children were born to this union - children not linked below:
2 CONT
2 CONT John Barnes Hartman - born March 4, 1858 in Parke County; marries September 15, 1878 in Parke, Sarepta Ann (Rep) Albright; died December 16, 1951 in Vigo County; buried in Clear Run Cemetery
2 CONT
2 CONT George B Hartman - born November 1861 in Parke County; marries April 8, 1886, Dora E. McCarty; died March 4, 1944/NOTE some families indicate birth date as November 14, 1864 - my birth date source = 1900 census
2 CONT
2 CONT Benjamin Franklin (Frank) Hartman - born April 18, 1871 in Parke County; marries May 11, 1892 in Parke, Margaret E (Maggie) Derr; marries second September 20, 1899, Cora D. Fleming; died January 1963 in Parke County; buried in Ada
2 CONC ms Cemetery
2 CONT
2 CONT NOTE: three children below have been duplicated - those not mine and no photo of stone are: Eliza J, Henrietta A and William H.
