1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Elizabeth "Betsy" Hawkins Barnes-Johnson
2 CONT
2 CONT Betsy's maiden name was Hawkins, born to Benjamin Hawkins and Anne Bourne. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Her first marriage (May 12, 1796; Brunswick County, VA) was to Moses Fielding Barnes (ca. 1780 - 1810). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Her second marriage (Oct. 22, 1812; Mercer County, KY) was to Robert Johnson.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=116587764
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.so-ky.com/books/mcgee/part-three.pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT She was born 6th of 10 children.
2 CONT
2 CONT vi. ELIZABETH "BETSY" HAWKINS, b. June 17, 1780; 
2 CONT
2 CONT m. (1) WILLIAM BARNES [Correction: m. Moses Fielding Barnes]
2 CONT
2 CONT m. (2) ROBERT JOHNSON, October 22, 1812. 
