1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/74724282/cornelia-connerley
2 CONT
2 CONT She was first married in Kentucky to McHenry Husbands (by 1860 she was a widow in Kentucky). 
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. She married William Barnes (father of Lafayette Barnes) 26 Aug 1855. His will indicates she was pregnant and he died in 1856. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. She married Joseph Barnes Sr 9 May 1865. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. She married John Connerly 13 Feb 1879. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Her daughter Billy Bell is buried next to her.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her parents were Spencer Gill and Rachel Powell. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She was a sister to Amy Shadiah "Shaddy" Gill Barnes and Elsey aka Elzira Gill who married James Barnes son of Moses Fielding Barnes and Elizabeth "Betsy" Hawkins.
