1 NOTE {geni:about_me} A Goldsmith of Lombard Street
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT WILLIAM FEAKE (1537-1595) married Margaret Mary Wetherell from St Mary Woolnoth, London. The family resided in London, where James (his father) was a goldsmith. He made his will, 7 May 1595, proven 19 May 1595. He desired burial i
2 CONC n the parish church of St. Edmund the King, in Lumbard Street, London, where he was a parishioner, at his pew door. 
