1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT WikiTree contributors, "Judith (Fisher) Thomas (1534-1589)," WikiTree: The Free Family Tree, (https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Fisher-8236 : accessed 23 July 2025).
2 CONT
2 CONT Judith FISHER, daughter of William FISHER, was born at England, and died before 6 Mar 1588/89 at St. Nicholas Acons Church, London, Middlesex, ENG, when she was buried there.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Robert THOMAS say 1565 at London, Middlesex, ENG; 
2 CONT
2 CONT children (surname THOMAS):
2 CONT
2 CONT # William - b. c1565; d. bef 28 Aug 1639; m. Martha BENETT
2 CONT # Humphrey - b. c1567; d. bef 12 Feb 1615; m. Jane COTTON
2 CONT # John - b. 1568; wpr. 15 Sep 1613
2 CONT # Judith - b. c1572; d. 21 Dec 1625; m. James FEAKE, goldsmith
2 CONT # Edward - b. c1575; bur. 27 Dec 1602
2 CONT # Sarah - b. c1578; d. 8 Sep 1613; m. George SOUTHCOTT, Kt. of Dartmouth
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
