2 CONT When Elizabeth Feake was born in 1633, in Cornhill St Michael, London, England, her father, Henry Feake, was 39 and her mother, Jane Woolstone, was 36. She married John Dillingham on 24 March 1650, in Sandwich, Plymouth Colony, Br
2 CONC itish Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 1 son and 3 daughters. She died on 15 December 1720, in Harwich, Barnstable, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, at the age of 87, and was buried in Dilling
2 CONC ham Cemetery, Brewster, Barnstable, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America.
