2 CONT
2 CONT Brother of Moses Lyon, Richard Lyon III, Hester (Lyon) Grumman, Elizabeth (Lyon) Marshall, Hannah (Lyon) Jennings, Samuel Lyon Sr, Joseph Lyon and Abigail (Lyon) Smith
