1 NOTE {geni:about_me} SARAH3 WOOLSEY (GEORGE "JORIS"2, GEORGE SR1) was born August 03, 1650 in NY - Flushing, Queens, and died August 18, 1734 in NY - Newtown, Long Island. She married CAPT. WILLIAM JR HALLETT December 01, 1669 in NY - 
2 CONC Newtown, son of WILLIAM HALLETT and ELIZABETH FONCE. He was born 1648 in CT - Greenwich, and died August 18, 1729.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Woolsey was born in New York August y 3 in ye year 1650 Au 7 she was Baptized in ye English church by Mr. Denton - Capt Newton godfather. 
2 CONT
2 CONT William Hallett, a son of William and Elizabeth (Fones) [Winthrop] {Feake} Hallett married Sarah Woolsey December 1, 1669 in Queens County. Sarah, a 
2 CONT
2 CONT daughter of George and Rebecca (Cornell) Woolsey, was born August 3, 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1650 in Flushing, Queens County and died after 1700.
