2 CONT Info provided on Find A Grave Memorial# 99970689 Rebecca Hallett Jackson was the daughter of Capt. William Hallett Jr and Sarah Woolsey. Rebecca was born in Halletts Cove, now Astoria, Long Island NewYork. Died in Rocky Hill, Flus
2 CONC hing, Queens Co., New York. Rebecca married James Jackson Sr. in 1694 in Halletts Cove, Long Island, New York. Rebecca and James had the following twenty childern: (1) Thomas Jackson b Dec 4, 1694 d April 12, 1730 m Mary Townsend.
2 CONC  (2) Mary Jackson b Jan 20, 1696/1697 d Sept 27, 1735 m Jacob Willetts. (3)Sarah Jackson b Dec 11, 1697 (4) Rebecca Jackson b Feb 20, 1698/1699 m Sylvanus Seamon. (5) John Jackson Sr b March 9, 1700/1701 d 1768/1772 m Sarah Doty. 
2 CONC (6) Charity Jackson b Feb 26, 1701/1702 m John Dingey (7) Elizabeth Jackson b March 20, 1703 m Nathaniel Field (8) James Jackson Jr b July 4, 1704 d 1750 m Sarah Thorne, m Mary Fitzrandolph. (9) William #1 Jackson b Jul 6, 1705 d 
2 CONC May 1706 (10) Hannah Jackson b Aug 5, 1706 d Sept 27, 1735, m. John Hicks m. John Hewlett (11) William #2 Jackson b Oct 4, 1707 d Oct 9,1746 (12) Martha Jackson b Jan 26, 1709 d 1735 m. William Green Jr (13) Gen'l Joseph Jackson b
2 CONC  Feb 9, 1710 d 1769 (14) Richard Jackson b March 20, 1711 d 1739 m Mary Townsend (15) Phoebe Jackson b May 3, 1712 d 1777 m Edward Fitz Randolph Jr (16) Robert Jackson b May 15, 1713 (17) Jemima Jackson b Nov 25, 1714 m Mr Hicks (
2 CONC 18) Samuel Jackson b July 21, 1716 m Sarah Carpenter (19) Stephen Jackson b Aug 17, 1717 m Mary Lewis (20) Benjamin Jackson Sr. b July 26, 1719 d 1805 m Mary Lively Rushing, m Amanda "Amy" Forrest.
