3 CONT NYS: 133
3 CONT Hooper, John, An oversight and deliberacion upon the prphete Jonas (1550)
3 CONT -- in his notes in Walther's Homilies above AW writes that "Mr John Hooper made sermons before King Edwarde the sixte, which are in printe"; he was familiar with it even if he didn't own it
3 CONT see NYS: 122
