3 CONT Adam, born 10 August 1548 in London, Middlesex Co., England, died 29 March 1622 in Groton, Suffolk Co., England; he married on 20 February 1578/1579 in Suffolk Co., England, Anne Browne. Parents of:
3 CONT Anne, born about 1579
3 CONT Anne, born 16 January 1584/1585 in England
3 CONT John, born 12 January 1586/1587 in Edwardstone, Suffolk, England, died 1649 in Massachusetts, he was Governor of the Massachusetts Bay Colony
3 CONT Jane, born June 1592
3 CONT Lucy, born 1 January 1599/1600 -------------------- http://www.deloriahurst.com/deloriahurst%20page/3206.html ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
3 CONC ------------------------------------------Birth: Aug. 10, 1548, England Death: Mar. 28, 1623, England
