2 CONT John WINTHROP [Parents] was born on 12 Jan 1587 in Groton Manor, Edwardstone, Sussex, England. He died on 26 Mar 1649 in Boston, Suffolk, Massachusetts. He was buried on 3 Apr 1649 in Boston, Suffolk, Massachusetts. He married Mar
2 CONC y FORTH on 16 Mar 1605 in Great Stambridge, Essex, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary FORTH [Parents] was born on 1 Jan 1583 in Great Stambridge, Essex, England. She died on 26 Jun 1615 in Groton, Suffolk, England. She was buried on 26 Jun 1615 in Groton, Suffolk, England. She married John WINTHROP on 16 Mar 1
2 CONC 605 in Great Stambridge, Essex, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT *  		F	i	 Mary WINTHROP was born on 30 Dec 1609 in Groton Manor, Suffolk, England. She died on 12 Apr 1643 in Salisbury, Essex, Ma. She was buried on 16 Apr 1643 in Boston, Suffolk, Massachusetts.
2 CONT *  		M	ii	 Harry Or Henry WINTHROP was born on 10 Jun 1608 in Groton Manor, Suffolk, England. He was christened on 20 Jan 1608 in Groton, Suffolk, England. He died on 2 Jul 1630 in Salem, Essex, Massachusetts.
2 CONT *  		F	iii	 Anne WINTHROP was born on 8 Aug 1614 in Groton, Suffolk, England. She was christened on 8 Aug 1614 in Groton, Suffolk, England. She died on 26 Aug 1614 in Groton, Suffolk, England. She was buried on 26 Aug 1614 in Grot
2 CONC on, Suffolk, England.
2 CONT *  		M	iv	 John WINTHROP was born on 12 Feb 1606. He died on 5 Apr 1676.
2 CONT *  		F	v	 Anne WINTHROP was born on 26 Jun 1615 in Groton, Suffolk, England. She died on 29 Jun 1615 in Groton, Suffolk, England. She was buried on 29 Jun 1615 in Groton, Suffolk, England.
2 CONT *  		M	vi	 Forth WINTHROP was born on 30 Dec 1609 in Groton Manor, Suffolk, England. He died on 23 Nov 1630 in (unmarried). He was buried on 23 Nov 1630
