2 CONT
2 CONT John Winthrop migrated to New England during the Puritan Great Migration (1621-1640). (See Great Migration Begins, by R. C. Anderson, Vol. 3, p. 2038)
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT Governor of the Massachusetts Bay Colony Company (in London) - Matthew Cradock
2 CONT 1st Governor of Massachusetts Bay Colony (in the colony) - John Endecott
2 CONT 2nd Governor of the Massachusetts Bay Colony - 1630-1634 - John Winthrop
2 CONT 3rd Governor - Thomas Dudley
2 CONT 5th Governor - Henry Vane
2 CONT 6th Governor of the Massachusetts Bay Colony - 1637-1640 - John Winthrop
2 CONT 7th Governor - Thomas Dudley
2 CONT 8th Governor - Richard Bellingham
2 CONT 9th Governor of the Massachusetts Bay Colony - 1642-1644 - John Winthrop
