2 NOTE who is John Winthrop?
1 OBJE
2 FILE https://media.geni.com/p2/4047/4802/534448366b3d8cd4/John_winthrop_illustration_original.jpg?hash=f0468b38f487806bb107e59a30c90b3c19bd252bf397d8224bdd7c5bf2c61bb7.1795075199
2 FORM jpg
