2 CONT
2 CONT Birthdate: January 9, 1601   Groton, Suffolk, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: Died April 19, 1679 London, Middlesex, England          
2 CONT
2 CONT Place of Burial: Suffolk, England 
2 CONT
2 CONT St Martin-in-the-Fields Churchyard  Westminster City of Westminster Greater London, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Adam Winthrop, III  Mother: Anne Browne 
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Rev. Emmanuel Downing  Married: April 10, 1622  St. Peter's, London, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of:  1.Lucy Downing 2.George Downing  3.Joshua Downing  4.Nicholas Downing 5.Robert Downing  6.Adam Downing  7.Ann Downing   8.Martha Downing 9.Dorcas Downing 10.Henry Downing  11.Dorcas Downing 12.John Downing 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of:  Sarah Winthrop;  infant Anne Winthrop;  Anne Fones, (Younger);  Gov. John Winthrop, Massachusetts Bay Colony  Jane Winthrop 
