1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT
2 CONT It has been reported that Elizabeth, wife of Charles Ludlam, was the dau. of Job Wright. Torrey says that she is Elizabeth Townsend, dau. of Henry and Deborah (Underhill) Townsend.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT The New York Genealogical and Biographical Record By Richard Henry Greene, Henry Reed Stiles, Melatiah Everett Dwight, George Austin Morrison, Hopper Striker Mott, John Reynolds Totten, New York Genealogical and Biographical Socie
2 CONC ty, Louis Effingham De Forest, Harold Minot Pitman, Conklin Mann, Charles Andrew Ditmas, Arthur S. Maynard
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Charles, 
2 CONT *b. 1,27,1691; 
2 CONT *d. Nov. 1,1769, aged 78years, 7 mo., 5 days; 
2 CONT *m. Elizabeth Townsend, 
2 CONT **b. 12.25.1692; 
2 CONT **d. 9.2. 1756, aged 63 years, 10 mo., 8 days; 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Seen as 
2 CONT **dau. of Job and Rachel (Townsend) Wright of Oyster Bay, L. I. Job descended from Peter and Alice Wright and Rachel from John and Susannah (Harcurt) Townsend.”
2 CONT
2 CONT But Torrey disproved this and shows the wife of Charles Ludlam as the daughter of Henry Townsend and Deborah Underhill.  See ([https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000206027557851 document attached])
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Charles Ludlum (Joseph, William). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT *1. i Charles Ludlam, 
2 CONT **b. March 4, 1717; 
2 CONT **d. ; 
2 CONT **m. Mary Weekes, dau. of Joseph and Hannah (Crocker) Weekes of Matinecock, L. I. They had seven children of whom only William married.
2 CONT *2. ii. Sylvanus (colloquially Bene) Ludlum, 
2 CONT **b. June 14, 1720; 
2 CONT **d. ; 
2 CONT **m. Ann Ingraham, widow Emerson. Son Jacob was a Tory in the Revolution and went to Nova Scotia and died there. His sister m. Daniel Bayles, and sisters Mary and Freelove, spinsters.
2 CONT *3. iii. Henry Ludlum, 
2 CONT **b. Oct. 16, 1722; 
2 CONT **d. 1791, in 60th year; 
2 CONT **m. Naomi Feke, b. 1733; d. 1807, aged 75; dau. of John and Abigail (Wright) Feke.
2 CONT *4. iv. Daniel Ludlum, 
2 CONT **b. April 2, 1725; 
2 CONT **was drowned; 
2 CONT **m. Margaret Wright, dau. of Gideon and Margaret (Urquhart) Wright.
2 CONT *5. v. Clemence (Ludlum) Carman, 
2 CONT **b. March 15, 1728; 
2 CONT **d. 9.25.1805, aged 77.6.9; 
2 CONT **m. ?Carman and had: Elizabeth, Deborah and Sarah.
2 CONT *6. vi. Elizabeth (Ludlum) Kissam, 
2 CONT **b. April 29, 1730; 
2 CONT **given name of her husband unknown; only child, William, b. 8.11.1752.
2 CONT *7. vii. Susannah (Ludlum) Hallock, 
2 CONT **b. Nov. 22, 1733; 
2 CONT **d. 7.27. 1753; 
2 CONT **m. Richard Hallock, b. 5.13.1724; d. 2.12.1821; son of William and Dinah Hallock, and had Henry, b. 11.11.1755, and Susannah, b. 12.10.1757.
2 CONT
