1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Ferris-13
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary was a Friend (Quaker)
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary was born 22 Feb 1663 in New Castle Twp, Westchester County, NY, the daughter of John Ferris and Mary Jackson.  She died 9 May 1715 in Westchester County, NY.
2 CONT
2 CONT Nathaniel Underhill and Mary Ferris announced their marriage intention at the New York (Flushing) Monthly Meeting on 27d 12m 1685 [27 Feb 1686].[1].
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.mygenealogyaddiction.com/Ancestors/Nathaniel-Underhill
2 CONT
2 CONT Nathaniel Underhill was born Feb. 22, 1663, son of Capt. John Underhill and his second wife, Elizabeth Feake. He married Mary Ferris in Oct. 1685.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT # Thomas Underhill, born Dec. 4, 1687.
2 CONT # Nathaniel Underhill II, born Aug. 11, 1670. [Link]
2 CONT # Benjamin Underhill, b. Aug. 1694, married Hannah ___ and had son, John Underhill.
2 CONT # Abraham Underhill, born 1697.
2 CONT # John Underhill, born 1700.
2 CONT # Mary Underhill, born 1704, married Joseph Horton and died 1765.
2 CONT # William Underhill, born Apr. 7, 1707
2 CONT
2 CONT
