2 CONT William was the last of 7 children (6 sons and 1 daughter) born of Nathaniel Underhill (1663-1710) and his wife Mary Ferris (1663-1750).  Williams siblings were: Thomas (1687-1762), Nathaniel (1690-1775), Benjamin (b. 1694), Abrah
2 CONC am (1697-1750), John (b. 1700), and Mary (1704-1765).   
2 CONT
2 CONT William married, December 26, 1729 at the First Presbyterian Church, Huntington, Long Island, Province of New York, Mary Bayley (1713-1791) by whom he had 5 children (4 sons and 1 daughter): Abraham (1730-1796), Freelove (1733-177
2 CONC 4), Augustine (1736-1819) John Calvin (1738-1808), and William (1741-1813).
2 CONT
