1 NOTE {geni:about_me} `````````````````````````````````````````````` Caroline and James were married 11 Nov 1762 at Flushing, Queens Co, NY, and they were the parents of:
2 CONT
2 CONT Catharine/1768 (Mrs John Murray) Walter/26 Sep 1770 m. Elizabeth Southgate Elizabeth/10 Mar 1772 (Mrs George Townsend) John Rodman/27 May 1774 Mary Rodman/18 Sep 1776 (Mrs John King) Caroline/25 Mar 1779
