2 CONT ''Genealogical Record, Volume 1''. By Saint Nicholas Society of the City of New York.  Page 97.  < [https://books.google.com/books?id=gJMwAQAAMAAJ&lpg=PA97&ots=jHCpdRRHm3&dq=Mary%20(Betts)%20Lawrence&pg=PA97#v=onepage&q=Mary%20(Be
