2 CONT Nathaniel Soule, born ca. 1753
2 CONT Samuel Soule, born 1756
2 CONT Job Soule, born 27 August 1757
2 CONT Hannah Soule, born ca. 1759
2 CONT Peace Soule, born ca. 1761
2 CONT Eleanor Soule, born ca. 1763
2 CONT Recompense Soule, born ca. 1765
2 CONT Sources
