2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT The Mayflower Society has estimated Rebecca Gifford's unrecorded birth at about 1689, based on the estimate of her husband's birth in 1687. She was probably the daughter of Robert and Sarah (Wing) Gifford.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Jacob Soule married Rebeckah Gifford Jan 22, 179 [page torn 1709?/10], in Dartmouth.[2][1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Rebeckah was not mentioned in Jacob's will dated 12 August 1747, in Dartmouth, implying her earlier decease.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children b. Dartmouth [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Child: Joseph Soule b. 16 Feb 1710/11
