2 CONT '''This Elizabeth's "sister" https://www.geni.com/people/Elizabeth-Hatfield/5674081078030033523 is the so-named daughter of Henry Hatfield and Alice Hercy.  The data of this Elizabeth do not match those of the so-named daughter of
2 CONC  Henry and Alice.  Furthermore, Stirnet's "Hatfeild1" page does not mention a marriage between the so-named daughter of Henry and Alice and Oliver Booth.  Further research is warranted.
