1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT THOMAS LANGDON II b c1673 d1734 (?) s/o Joseph Langdon & Mary (Osborne) m-1 unknown lady m-2 MARY (maiden surname unknown) ALBURTUS, widow of Arthur Alburtus of Hempstead. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas and Mary were married in 1727 at St. George's Church, Hempstead, L.I. In 1732 Thomas was living at Jerusalem, L.I. He was doubtless a farmer. At various times he took up large grants of land in the South Woods of Hempstead(
2 CONC HTR 8:327/28, 346,485). His will, dated 1733 and probated 27 May 1734, mentions his wife, Mary, and the children listed below. 
2 CONT
2 CONT THE KNOWN CHILDREN OF THOMAS LANGDON II : 
2 CONT
2 CONT M-1 
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1.+ Joseph b c1700 
2 CONT *  2. Elizabeth b c1702 m Capt. John Birdsell s/o Benjamin & Mercy Fortian of Hempstead.  
2 CONT * 3. Deborah b c1704/08 m Cornelius Losee of Hempstead.  
2 CONT * 4. Thomas b c1710. He moved to Duchess County, NY in 1735 or before.  
2 CONT * 5.+ Jonathan b c1710. He also moved to Duchess Co. NY in 1740 or sooner.  
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
