2 CONC , Ardon, Marriages of the Seamans taken from the records of the Town, State, and Church, (NY: privately published, 1866), Elizabeth [Seaman] mar. Robert Stewart, Oct. 28, 1781., (3) Armbruster, Eugene L., Marriages of Long Island 
