2 CONT * The New York Genealogical and Biographical Record, Volume 37.  Records of The Reformed Dutch Church.  Search on Geertje Winter: < [https://books.google.com/books?id=qtUUAAAAYAAJ&lpg=PA372&ots=_zH7IH8Opd&dq=Geertje%20(Winter)%20W
2 CONC ood&pg=PA33#v=onepage&q=Geertje%20(Winter)%20Wood&f=false GoogleBooks] > Search on Jemima Mott: < [https://books.google.com/books?id=qtUUAAAAYAAJ&lpg=PA372&ots=_zH7IH8Opd&dq=Geertje%20(Winter)%20Wood&pg=PA130#v=snippet&q=Jemima%20
2 CONC (Mott)%20Wood&f=false GoogleBooks] >
