1 NOTE {geni:about_me} JOHN DOTY, (3d son of Joseph Doty, 1st,) and Sarah Potter, lived in Stony Hill Valley, near, but west of his father's house, and had children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT # Chloe, who died 27th November, 1772, unmarried. 
2 CONT # James, born 10th January, 1756, married, 29th September, * 1788, Nancy Locey, daughter of Daniel Locey, of Mendham. 
2 CONT
2 CONT John Doty's wife then died, and he married Sarah Clark, daughter »f Daniel, and had children:
2 CONT
2 CONT # Daniel, born 23d March, 1765, and married, 1st, Elizabeth Potter, 2d, Betsey Crane, daughter of Joseph, and went to Middletown, Ohio, and settled there.
2 CONT # John Doty, Jun., married Phebe Cooper, of Hanover, and removed to Western New York, and from thence to Middletown, Ohio.
2 CONT # Zina went to Ohio, with his father and family, and married there.
2 CONT # Betsey married, 22d March, 1794, Stephanus Clark, Jun., and went to Ohio. [See Stephanus Clark.]
2 CONT # Jane went with her father to Ohio, and married Samnel Clark, there.
2 CONT # Chloe, 2d, died 27th December, 1784.
2 CONT # Ketura, who died young.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT * Littell, John. Family Records : Or, Genealogies of the First Settlers of Passaic Valley (and Vicinity). Baltimore: Geneal. Pub., 1976. Print.
