1 CONT From Mary Powell Bunker, LI Genealogies.
1 CONT She has the wife of John Bowne as Elizabeth, sister of Hannah. According to the Cocks Genealogy, Elizabeth was the wife of Captain John Underhill.
1 CONT Also from LI Genealogies, or from F.E.Weeks, comes Hannah's birthplace given as England. George Cocks has her birthplace as (supposedly) Watertown, Massachussetts. She died in England on one of her religious visits (Quaker). See n
1 CONC otes under John Bowne for details.
