1 CONT • "Joseph a member of the Society of Friends came from England & first settle in Pennsylvania (1714).  He removed to the Valley of Virginia (1741) bringing his wife & 8 children with him.  He was then about fifty years of age - wa
1 CONC s born in 1690."
1 CONT • "Came from England to Chester County, Pennsylvania 1714 then to Shenandoah Valley, Virgina in 1741."
1 CONT • Died in his 72nd year.
