1 CONT Isaac Frost was born 1717. He and his wife Mary lived in Dutchess Co. The y had fourteen children, the youngest George Frost, born 1760 married Sar ah Underhill. They had eleven children and they lived in Dutchess Co. Al l the chi
1 CONC ldren were born there. In the year 1805 they moved to Albany Co. , town of Renseville (Rensselaerville?) where they afterwards lived and d ied. George was sick for thirty years before he died. One of George Frost 's sons, Caleb Fr
1 CONC ost, born 1795, kept the old homestead and married Miria m Drake. They had twelve children. His oldest son Edward Frost married Ph ebe Hagadorn and had five children. Edward Frost was born 1822 and his on ly son Arthur was born 18
1 CONC 57.
