1 CONT Compiled from a Register of Family Records, similar to a ledger, locate d at the Durham Center Museum. The Register seems to be primarily in th e handwriting of Priscilla A. Frost, circa 1870, although there are othe r records wri
1 CONC tten in different handwriting.
1 CONT Primary families: Drake, Frost, Tanner, Hollenbeck, Dean, Underhill, Haga dorn
1 CONT Page 27:
1 CONT Isaac Frost was born 1717. He and his wife Mary lived in Dutchess Co. The y had fourteen children, the youngest George Frost, born 1760 married Sar ah Underhill. They had eleven children and they lived in Dutchess Co. Al l the chi
1 CONC ldren were born there. In the year 1805 they moved to Albany Co. , town of Renseville (Rensselaerville?) where they afterwards lived and d ied. George was sick for thirty years before he died. One of George Frost 's sons, Caleb Fr
1 CONC ost, born 1795, kept the old homestead and married Miria m Drake. They had twelve children. His oldest son Edward Frost married Ph ebe Hagadorn and had five children. Edward Frost was born 1822 and his on ly son Arthur was born 18
1 CONC 57.
1 CONT Page 3:
1 CONT Isaac Frost b. April 3, 1718
1 CONT Mary Frost b. June 3, 1722
1 CONT Children of Isaac and Mary Frost:
1 CONT Anna Frost married Thomas Thadbolt
1 CONT Sarah Frost married Benjamin Worden
1 CONT Hannah Frost married Daniel Lawrence
1 CONT Mary Frost married Thomas Stringham and had 10 children, the youngest Mar y married Benjamin Sheldon
1 CONT Rhoda Frost married Isaac Cook and James Baker
1 CONT Elizabeth Frost married Obadia Powell
1 CONT Ethelannah Frost married Jonathan Wright of Long Island
1 CONT Obediah Frost married Underhill and Halsted
1 CONT Mordecai Frost married Underhill and Weeks
1 CONT James Frost never married
1 CONT Solomon Frost married Anna Vail
1 CONT Isaac Frost married Patience Haight of Nova Scotia
1 CONT Jordon Frost was born February 11, 1754 and married Amy Underhill
1 CONT George Frost was born March 11, 1760
1 CONT Page 9:
1 CONT George Frost and Sarah Underhill was married December 1781
1 CONT Gerrardus Drake and Anna Dean was married November 13, 1788
1 CONT Gerrardus Drake and Catharine Frost was married February 1808
1 CONT Caleb Frost and Miriam Drake was married September 30, 1819
1 CONT Edward Frost and Phebe A. Hagedorn was married December 30, 1819
1 CONT William M. Clelland and Catharine Frost was married January 15, 1846
1 CONT Emmor H. Haight and Anna Frost was married November 3, 1853
1 CONT Edward Wood and Jane Frost was married January 3, 1854
1 CONT John Drake Frost and Mary Jane Morham (sp?) was married November 29, 1854
1 CONT William D. Frost and H. Ellen Tewksbury was married June 11, 1862
1 CONT John Drake Frost and Phobe Sheldon was married October 10, 1860
1 CONT Isreal G. Frost and Lydia Chadwick was married September 15, 1868
1 CONT Emmor H. Haight and Matilda Frost married May 4, 1892
