1 CONC ensus recorded in Spartanburg Dist. SC...."prepared his will 23 Aug 1805....inventory of the estate was filed 10 Feb. 1806." 
1 CONT _________________________________
1 CONT
1 CONT For Isaac Cantrell from Sources sent in for the Cantrell Cousins Project ---- "The Early Bethells and Their Descendants by Garde..........'Isaac moved his family to Rockingham Co., NC ca 1737'."
1 CONT
