1 CONT It's known Robert Feake had a nephew Tobias (Toby); what's unknown is who his parents are. Perhaps Judith, Robert's sister is his mother, being unmarried at the time of his birth? John Fitton thinks Robert had a brother James who 
1 CONC had children named Judith and Tobias.
1 CONT Tobias was a Schout (Sheriff) on Long Island when it was still being controlled by the Dutch West Indies Company and was one of the signers of the Flushing Remonstrance in 1656, the first declaration for religious freedom in Ameri
1 CONC ca (instigated by John Bowne).
1 CONT (I believe Toby married the Dutch widow of Daniel Patrick. I don't remember just now where that bit of information comes from.)
