1 CONT
1 CONT Lucy was the fourth daughter of Adam and Ann. She was born "in the year 1600 on Friday the 9th day of January in the 43rd year of the reign of Queen Elizabeth."
1 CONT This descendant information comes from Norris Taylor, posted at GenWeb 29 January 1999.
1 CONT Birth, christening (27 January 1600) and death information, from LDS Ancestral File.
1 CONT
1 CONT http://genforum.genealogy.com/winthrop/messages/3.html
1 CONT Lucy Winthrop, b 1601
1 CONT Posted by: Norris Taylor Date: January 29, 1999 at 21:08:38
1 CONT    of 281
1 CONT
1 CONT I don't have info on the Jane you ask about, but do have Lucy's lineage to the younger Adams president, so she had at least one child. John Adams, as you know, was on a par with Jefferson, Washington, Franklin in the founding of o
1 CONC ur country. She is not an ancestress of John, but of John Quincy, the son.
1 CONT I decided to start another thread, because you labelled the other one for Jane.
1 CONT
1 CONT Descendants of Lucy Winthrop
1 CONT
1 CONT 1 Lucy Winthrop 1601 - 1679
1 CONT .. +Emanuel Downing 1585 - 1660
1 CONT .... 2 George Downing, Sir 1623 - 1684
1 CONT Downing Street in London named for him.
1 CONT
1 CONT .... 2 Lucy Downing 1621 - 1698
1 CONT ........ +William Norton 1621 - 1694
1 CONT ........... 3 John Norton 1651 - 1716
1 CONT ............... +Mary Mason 1651 - 1740
1 CONT .................. 4 Elizabeth Norton 1696 -
1 CONT ...................... +John Quincy 1689 - 1767
1 CONT ........................ 5 Elizabeth Quincy 1721 - 1755
1 CONT ............................ +William Smith 1707 - 1783
1 CONT ............................... 6 Abigail Smith 1744 - 1818
1 CONT ................................... +John Adams 1735 - 1826 President
1 CONT ...................................... 7 John Quincy Adams 1767 - 1848 President
1 CONT .......................................... +Louisa Catherine Johnson 1775 - 1852
1 CONT
1 CONT Source: Ancestors of American Presidents, Gary Boyd Roberts, 1998.
