0 @N6000000000171119661@ NOTE See Frost Genealogy; also see Cox Genealogy for Sarah's mother.  In the Bible Records of Jacob Frost 1752-1837, Sarah is shown as the child of Joseph and Martha Frost (and Jacob's sister), born 16 June 1755 (Adriance Memorial Libr
1 CONC ary, Poughkeepsie, New York).  However, in both the Frost and Cox genealogies, she is known as daughter of Isaac and Mary (Cock) Frost.  This is further confirmed by her brother James' will, in which he names the children of his d
1 CONC eceased sister Sarah Worden.  Therefore, the bible record for Jacob Frost 1752-1837 seems to be in error.
