1 CONT Notes for MARY DUNCAN:
1 CONT Email from Dawn Shirley.  It was told that when Mary had become sick that her father Jonathan, her sister Charles Ann and her daughter May went all the way to Philadelphia to see her.  Back then that was not an easy trip to make. 
1 CONC  When they got there they found her laying on the living room sofa.  she wanted to show her sister the dress that she had just made.  It was told that it was beautiful.  She told them that this would be the dress that she would be
1 CONC  buried in.  Ome week later back in Pitman Jonathan was said to have told Charles Ann that Mary had just died.  She asked him jow he knew and he replied "she just called out to me".  Within just a few minutes a store clerk from do
1 CONC wn the street walked up to tell them the news that he had just received a call that Mary had in fact passed away.  Mary was bureid with her in-laws. (W53)
1 CONT
