1 CONT Early New Jersey Marriages - Extracts from microfilm copies of original marriage bonds in possession of NJ Dept. of  Education, Division of State Library Archives & History, filmed in 1966. "Marriages are from various counties, an
1 CONC d are arranged in groups by surname, but not alphabetical within groups." (Family History Library Catalog; 0888701-0888710) I have capitalized all surnames for ease in identification. When there was a discrepancy with a name in th
1 CONC e body of the bond and the signature, the difference of the signature is in parentheses An asteric * indicates spelling of a locality as found in document.
1 CONT
