1 CONC  grandchildren, 19 great grandchildren and 20 great great grandchildren... Mrs Joseph Layer died a year earlier (W4)
1 CONT
1 CONT In the 1905 census, Mary is listed as a Widow.  Living with her are James A Watson and Harry R. Watson.  The record notes that she owns her home free.  Occupation is listed as a housekeeper. (W20)
1 CONT
