1 CONT 1880 census has Mary (age 34) along with her husband Mark and Thomas (age 18), Sarah (age 15), Mary (age 14), Ann (age 12), Herbert (age 9), aaron (age 6), Mark (age 3) and James (age 1).  The family lives at  2118 Nicholas St., P
1 CONC hiladelphia, PA. Mary's occupation is listed as a None.  His son Thomas is listed as a boxmaker.  Both Mary and his parents are shown as having been born in NJ.  (W24)
