1 CONT WATSON'S IN WATSONTOWN NJ
1 CONT Posted by: Dawn Shirley (ID *****4853) Date: June 28, 2002 at 12:08:01
1 CONT of 10750
1 CONT
1 CONT I'm looking for any family members that are from Watsontown NJ. I only have names that I have recived from the Berlin Cemetery in Camden NJ. My ggggg-grandfather was Frederick Watson born around 1803 and died 1887 his wife was Ide
1 CONC lia Nesbitt born around 1804 and died 1868.One of There daughter's was Jane(Watson)Holloway she would be my fourth great grandmother.As far as I can tell the family lived in Watsontown most of there lives. Would love any help.
