1 CONC ).  The family lives at  2118 Nicholas St., Philadelphia, PA.  Mark's occupation is listed as a box maker.  His son Thomas is also listed as a boxmaker.  Both Mark and his parents are shown as having been born in NJ.  (W24)
1 CONT
